+02:00","backoffice_id":261931,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":544401,"date_start":"2022-11-17","date_end":"2022-11-19","date_next":"2022-11-17","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":71,"translations":{"fr":"March\u00e9s & brocantes","nl":"Markten & brocante","en":"Markets and bric-a-brac stores","de":"M\u00e4rkte & Flohm\u00e4rkte"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":"Une quarantaine de cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7ices participant\u00b7es vendent leur stock des ann\u00e9es pr\u00e9c\u00e9dentes \u00e0 prix r\u00e9duits!","longdescr":"MAD Brussels, Knack Weekend et Le Vif Weekend presentent - les Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales!\r\n\r\nSoutenez votre cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7ice ou votre marque bruxelloise locale pendant les Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales! Une quarantaine de cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7ices participant\u00b7es vendent leur stock des ann\u00e9es pr\u00e9c\u00e9dentes \u00e0 prix r\u00e9duits. LE moment pour s'offrir un v\u00eatement, un accessoire ou un objet de votre cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7ice bruxellois\u00b7e pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9\u00b7e !\r\n\r\nL'\u00e9dition d'hiver 2022 a pour but de r\u00e9unir les marques de mode et de design bruxelloises \u00e9tablies et les jeunes designers en devenir. Le design bruxellois sous son meilleur jour! Il y a des marques qui ont un stand chez MAD Brussels et des marques qui participent avec leur propre point de vente. Toutes les informations peuvent \u00eatre trouv\u00e9es sur www.mad.brussels.\r\n\r\nMARQUES ET MAGASINS PARTICIPANTS\r\n\r\nFarrah Floyd \u2014 Annemie Verbeke \u2014 Catalina J \u2014 Slip Belge \u2014 Raffaelien Studio \u2014 Les Vraies Filles \u2014 Sarah de Saint Hubert \u2014 Val\u00e9rie Berckmans \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 An Buermans \u2014 Vimpelova \u2014 Jessie Lecomte \u2014 Els Mommaerts \u2014 Just in Case \u2014 Miono \u2014 Dorilou \u2014 Bijoux Ortiz \u2014 Wendy Malinovsky \u2014 Around Mrs. O \u2014 WORLD OF  WONDER \u2014 MY BOB \u2014 Antoine Ellyton \u2014 Anna Ivakhnenko \u2014 AKASO \u2014 Belle Callie \u2014 Auqui\u00e8re Ateliers \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 Nina Meert \u2014 Audrey Ickx \u2014 St\u00e9phanie Anspach \u2014 Simple \u2014 Karen Dumoulin \u2014 oZ\u00e9 \u2014 Heterodoxa \u2014 Molka \u2014 Oxana Yan \u2014 ANTONIOTUO \u2014 Florent Seligmann \u2014 Margot Van Den Berghe \u2014 Skin Series \u2014 Studio Minim\u00e8tre \u2014 Stefan Kartchev \u2014 Kasbah Kosmic \u2014 Kana Arioka \u2014 Rafael Dorian \u2014 Atelier Margo \u2014 Even \u2014 Nymfavintage \u2014 Tuya-Sar \u2014 Tirez-vous-les-filles \u2014 N.D.C. made by hand \u2014 Frizbee Ceramics","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":"Meer dan 40 deelnemende ontwerpers verkopen hun voorraad van voorgaande jaren tegen gereduceerde prijzen!","longdescr":"MAD Brussels, Knack Weekend en Le Vif Weekend presenteren - The Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales!\r\n\r\nSteun lokale Brusselse ontwerpers en merken tijdens de Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales! Meer dan 40 deelnemende designers verkopen hun stock van de voorbije jaren aan verminderde prijzen. H\u00e9t moment om een kledingstuk, accessoire of object van je favoriete Brusselse ontwerper op de kop te tikken!\r\n\r\nDe wintereditie van 2022 wil gevestigde Brusselse mode- & designmerken en jonge, opkomende ontwerpers samenbrengen. Brussels design op zijn best! Er zijn merken die een stand hebben bij MAD Brussels en merken die deelnemen met een eigen outlet. Alle informatie is te vinden op www.mad.brussels.\r\n\r\nDEELNEMENDE MERKEN & WINKELS\r\n\r\nFarrah Floyd \u2014 Annemie Verbeke \u2014 Catalina J \u2014 Slip Belge \u2014 Raffaelien Studio \u2014 Les Vraies Filles \u2014 Sarah de Saint Hubert \u2014 Val\u00e9rie Berckmans \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 An Buermans \u2014 Vimpelova \u2014 Jessie Lecomte \u2014 Els Mommaerts \u2014 Just in Case \u2014 Miono \u2014 Dorilou \u2014 Bijoux Ortiz \u2014 Wendy Malinovsky \u2014 Around Mrs. O \u2014 WORLD OF  WONDER \u2014 MY BOB \u2014 Antoine Ellyton \u2014 Anna Ivakhnenko \u2014 AKASO \u2014 Belle Callie \u2014 Auqui\u00e8re Ateliers \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 Nina Meert \u2014 Audrey Ickx \u2014 St\u00e9phanie Anspach \u2014 Simple \u2014 Karen Dumoulin \u2014 oZ\u00e9 \u2014 Heterodoxa \u2014 Molka \u2014 Oxana Yan \u2014 ANTONIOTUO \u2014 Florent Seligmann \u2014 Margot Van Den Berghe \u2014 Skin Series \u2014 Studio Minim\u00e8tre \u2014 Stefan Kartchev \u2014 Kasbah Kosmic \u2014 Kana Arioka \u2014 Rafael Dorian \u2014 Atelier Margo \u2014 Even \u2014 Nymfavintage \u2014 Tuya-Sar \u2014 Tirez-vous-les-filles \u2014 N.D.C. made by hand \u2014 Frizbee Ceramics","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/brussels-fashion-designers-sales-winter-edition-2022","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"},"en":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":"More than 40 participating designers sell their stock from previous years at reduced prices!","longdescr":"MAD Brussels, Knack Weekend and Le Vif Weekend presente - The Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales!\r\n\r\nSupport your local Brussels designer or brand during the Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales! More than 40 participating designers sell their stock from previous years at reduced prices. THE perfect occasion to buy a piece of clothing, an accessory or an object from your favourite Brussels designer!\r\n\r\nThe winter edition of 2022 is all about reuniting established Brussels fashion & design brands with young, upcoming designers. Brussels design at its best! There are brands having a stand at MAD Brussels and brands participating with their own outlet. All the information can be found on www.mad.brussels.\r\n\r\nPARTICIPATING BRANDS & SHOPS\r\n\r\nFarrah Floyd \u2014 Annemie Verbeke \u2014 Catalina J \u2014 Slip Belge \u2014 Raffaelien Studio \u2014 Les Vraies Filles \u2014 Sarah de Saint Hubert \u2014 Val\u00e9rie Berckmans \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 An Buermans \u2014 Vimpelova \u2014 Jessie Lecomte \u2014 Els Mommaerts \u2014 Just in Case \u2014 Miono \u2014 Dorilou \u2014 Bijoux Ortiz \u2014 Wendy Malinovsky \u2014 Around Mrs. O \u2014 WORLD OF  WONDER \u2014 MY BOB \u2014 Antoine Ellyton \u2014 Anna Ivakhnenko \u2014 AKASO \u2014 Belle Callie \u2014 Auqui\u00e8re Ateliers \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 Nina Meert \u2014 Audrey Ickx \u2014 St\u00e9phanie Anspach \u2014 Simple \u2014 Karen Dumoulin \u2014 oZ\u00e9 \u2014 Heterodoxa \u2014 Molka \u2014 Oxana Yan \u2014 ANTONIOTUO \u2014 Florent Seligmann \u2014 Margot Van Den Berghe \u2014 Skin Series \u2014 Studio Minim\u00e8tre \u2014 Stefan Kartchev \u2014 Kasbah Kosmic \u2014 Kana Arioka \u2014 Rafael Dorian \u2014 Atelier Margo \u2014 Even \u2014 Nymfavintage \u2014 Tuya-Sar \u2014 Tirez-vous-les-filles \u2014 N.D.C. made by hand \u2014 Frizbee Ceramics","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"},"de":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"},"it":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"},"cn":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544401"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["C