1-20","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"},{"day":"2022-11-22","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"},{"day":"2022-11-23","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"},{"day":"2022-11-24","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"},{"day":"2022-11-25","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"},{"day":"2022-11-26","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"},{"day":"2022-11-27","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"}],"weekschema":[{"days":{"monday":{"is_open":false},"tuesday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"}]},"wednesday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"}]},"thursday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"}]},"friday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"}]},"saturday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"}]},"sunday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00"}]}},"translations":{"fr":["lundi: ferm\u00e9","mardi, mercredi, jeudi, vendredi, samedi et dimanche: de 10:00 \u00e0 17:00"],"nl":["maandag: gesloten","dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag, vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: van 10:00 tot 17:00"],"en":["monday: closed","tuesday, wednesday, thursday, friday, saturday and sunday: from 10:00 to 17:00"]},"date_start":"2022-09-17","date_end":"2022-11-27","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":5},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"}},"value":0},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young people"}},"value":3},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"}},"value":3},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"},"nl":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"},"en":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"}},"value":0},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Etudiants"},"nl":{"name":"Studenten"},"en":{"name":"Students"}},"value":3},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-11-17T02:06:40+01:00","published_at":"2022-09-30T15:50:26+02:00","backoffice_id":262865,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.43679023236815},{"id":545242,"date_start":"2022-11-10","date_end":"2022-12-03","date_next":"2022-11-17","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[55],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de marionnettes"],"nl":["Poppentheater"],"en":["Puppet show"],"de":["Puppentheater"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":"Parodie pour marionnettes, en bruxellois fran\u00e7ais.","longdescr":"d\u2019apr\u00e8s Herman Closson et la tradition populaire.\r\n\r\nLorsque les Com\u00e9diens Routiers Belges (notre futur Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National de Belgique)\r\ncr\u00e9\u00e8rent sous l\u2019impulsion des fr\u00e8res fondateurs Maurice et Jacques Huisman,\r\n\"Le Jeu des Quatre Fils Aymon\" de Herman Closson, au Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal des Galeries,\r\nle 8 d\u00e9cembre 1941, la pi\u00e8ce fut rapidement censur\u00e9e.\r\nComme l\u2019\u00e9crit Philip Tirard dans son remarquable ouvrage consacr\u00e9 \u00e0\r\nJacques Huisman, \"une pi\u00e8ce qui engageait parfois les\r\nspectateurs \u00e0 se lever et \u00e0 entonner La Braban\u00e7onne\" (notre\r\nhymne national).\r\nInterdite \u00e0 Bruxelles en raison de ses appels \u00e0 la r\u00e9sistance, l\u2019oeuvre sera pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e\r\nen tourn\u00e9e dans toute la Wallonie sous l\u2019appellation d\u00e9guis\u00e9e de \"Cheval Bayard\".\r\nElle suscitera l\u2019enthousiasme g\u00e9n\u00e9ral.\r\nInspir\u00e9 par la tradition populaire et par la pi\u00e8ce de son professeur au Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles, Herman Closson, le jeune Toone VII a r\u00e9\u00e9crit cette chanson de geste des vassaux rebelles en une savoureuse adaptation bruxelloise. Cette version emprunte son premier acte \u00e0 la tradition orale des Toone du pass\u00e9 (avant la naissance des fils Aymon) tandis que le deuxi\u00e8me acte est con\u00e7u dans l\u2019esprit de Closson et gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la complicit\u00e9 bienveillante de leur auteur.\r\nDans cette sombre histoire de famille, Charlemagne va poursuivre les quatre fils rebelles qui ne devront leur salut qu\u2019au cheval bondissant, Bayard, envoy\u00e9 par l\u2019enchanteur Maugis. Ce dernier va substituer la ruse \u00e0 la force brutale des chevaliers.\r\nLe suzerain va prendre le timbre de voix \"vieille France\" d\u2019un autre Charles (de Gaulle), grand lui aussi par la taille et le prestige.\r\nDes faits h\u00e9ro\u00efques mais aussi de l\u2019amour \u00e9maillent cette \u00e9pop\u00e9e du moyen age.\r\nA la vue de la belle Al\u00e9\u00efs de Provence, le coeur du redoutable Renaud fait des \"cumulets\" dans sa poitrine.\r\nLa partie d\u2019\u00e9checs, v\u00e9ritable joute intellectuelle entre Bertholet et Renaud dans la tradition m\u00e9di\u00e9vale, sera \u00e0 l\u2019origine d\u2019une r\u00e9bellion in\u00e9luctable.\r\nQu\u2019importe le si\u00e8ge qui doit affamer les h\u00e9ros, ils seront ravitaill\u00e9s par catapultes \u00e0 coups de \u2026 jambons. \"Un jambon ? Mais c\u2019est toute la terre des Ardennes qui sauve ses enfants !\"\r\nLa voix de Nicolas G\u00e9al - Toone VIII prend toutes les intonations : solennelles, alti\u00e8res, s\u00e9pulcrales, gouailleuses, minaudantes, d\u00e9daigneuses\u2026\r\nLe cheval Bayard et les marionnettes des Quatre Fils Aymon ont fait l\u2019objet d\u2019une acquisition par le service du Patrimoine de la Communaut\u00e9 Fran\u00e7aise.\r\nLa pi\u00e8ce a \u00e9t\u00e9 jou\u00e9e avec succ\u00e8s en version italienne \u00e0 Messine et en version allemande \u00e0 Dortmund.\r\nLes d\u00e9cors sont dus au talent de Raymond Goffin. Quant aux costumes, ils sont confectionn\u00e9s par notre f\u00e9e, Lidia Gosamo.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"},"nl":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"},"en":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"},"de":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"},"it":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"},"sp":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"},"pt":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"},"cn":{"name":"Les Quatre Fils Aymon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545242"}},"place":{"id":231143,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone: un th\u00e9\u00e2tre original et authentique, impr\u00e9gn\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et de culture bruxelloise !\r\nId\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand-Place, dans une maison v\u00e9n\u00e9rable datant de 1696, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone poursuit la tradition s\u00e9culaire du th\u00e9\u00e2tre populaire de marionnettes depuis 1830. \r\nLa programmation est bas\u00e9e sur les grands classiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre tels que \u00ab Les Trois Mousquetaires \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s Alexandre Dumas ou encore \u00ab Rom\u00e9o et Juliette \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare.\r\nActuellement, le mus\u00e9e permanent de Toone situ\u00e9 au premier \u00e9tage du b\u00e2timent principal se visite gratuitement pendant l\u2019entracte.\r\nL\u2019estaminet folklorique au rez-de-chauss\u00e9e est ouvert tous les jours de 12h00 \u00e0 24h00, sauf le lundi (jour de fermeture).\r\nC\u2019est  un estaminet tricentenaire o\u00f9, dans une ambiance authentique de briques roses espagnoles, poutres noircies et sol dall\u00e9, vous pourrez appr\u00e9cier quelques bi\u00e8res, dont la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gueuze. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Poppentheater Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Traditioneel marionettentheater Brusselse folklore - Typisch Staminee.\r\nMuseum van Toone: Gratis toegang voor het publiek tijdens de pauze.\r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone in Brussel is een origineel en authentiek poppentheater dat doorspekt is van Brusselse geschiedenis en cultuur! \r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone zet sinds 1830 de eeuwenoude traditie van het volkse Theater voort.\r\nDe programmatie is gebaseerd op grote toneelklassiekers zoals \"Cyrano de Bergerac\" van Edmond Rostand, \"De Drie Musketiers\" van Alexandre Dumas, \"Romeo en Julia\" van William Shakespeare en \"Tijl Uilenspiegel\" van Charles De Coster. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"During the Spanish occupation of the Netherlands all theaters were closed to prevent the actors from raising satirical pieces against the Spanish rulers. As a result, doll shows came into play: it was easier to tolerate the fierce dialogues when pronounced by lifeless dolls. About 1830 Antoine \"Toone\" Genty opened  a puppet theater, then in the Marolles. More than 180 years later, this popular entertainment has grown into a Royal Puppet Theater. After Genty, his (unrelated) successors would also be called Toone (Antoine).\r\nThe classics are performed in the local Brussels dialect with wooden puppets (the so-called poechenel), sometimes in Dutch or in French. The puppet theater and museum has been located near the Grand Place for four decades. The theater is located on the upper floors of the building, on the ground floor there is a pub. The museum contains old dolls, including 19th century specimens.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Marionettentheater - Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"W\u00e4hrend der spanischen Besetzung der Niederlande wurden zwangsweise s\u00e4mtliche Theater geschlossen, um Kritik - in Form von satirischen St\u00fccken - an den spanischen Herrschern zu unterbinden. Die Br\u00fcsseler haben alsdann die Schauspieler durch Marionetten (\"Poechenelles\" in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart) ersetzt, die in illegalen Theatern auftragen. \r\nAnfang des 19. Jahrhunderts z\u00e4hlten die Br\u00fcsseler Marionettentheater zu den beliebtesten Vergn\u00fcgungen f\u00fcr Erwachsene, denn sie boten eine enorme Freiheit, ben\u00f6tigen nur wenig finanzielle Mittel und konnten \u00fcberall aufgef\u00fchrt werden. Ihr Repertoire ist bis heute sehr vielf\u00e4ltig und reicht von volkst\u00fcmlichen Legenden \u00fcber Rittergeschichten bis hin zu religi\u00f6sen oder historischen St\u00fccken, die sehr frei interpretiert werden. \r\nSeit der Gr\u00fcndung des Theaters im Marollenviertel ist nun bereits die 9. Puppenspielergeneration der Toone-Dynastie am Werk. Der jeweils neue Toone (Br\u00fcsseler Kosename f\u00fcr \"Antoine\", so der Vorname des Gr\u00fcnders) muss sowohl von seinem Vorg\u00e4nger als auch von dem Publikum angenommen werden - und so ist es nicht unbedingt der jeweilige Sohn, der die Nachfolge antritt. \r\nDie Klassiker werden in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart und manchmal auch auf Niederl\u00e4ndisch oder Franz\u00f6sisch aufgef\u00fchrt. \r\nDas Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone birgt auch ein urige Schenke und ein Marionettenmuseum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Teatro Reale di Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Traditional Brussels\u2019 puppet theater & museum - Typical caf\u00e9\r\nBordering the Impasses Schuddeveld and Sainte-P\u00e9tronille, you will find one of the favourite places of Brussels citizens: Le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone.\r\nTheater Toone is simultaneously a typical estaminet with its Spanish pink brick walls, blackened beams and tiled floor, a puppet theatre in the attic, with its wooden benches, festooned, multicoloured cushions nailed into the raw wood planks and a puppet museum. There, we find the characters who retired from the stage, these Toone heroes of the past and fetish characters of fellow puppeteers from around the world.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Teatro Real Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":[],"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":913,"location":{"lat":null,"lon":null},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-11-13T02:05:20+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:54+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":231143,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone: un th\u00e9\u00e2tre original et authentique, impr\u00e9gn\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et de culture bruxelloise !\r\nId\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand-Place, dans une maison v\u00e9n\u00e9rable datant de 1696, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone poursuit la tradition s\u00e9culaire du th\u00e9\u00e2tre populaire de marionnettes depuis 1830. \r\nLa programmation est bas\u00e9e sur les grands classiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre tels que \u00ab Les Trois Mousquetaires \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s Alexandre Dumas ou encore \u00ab Rom\u00e9o et Juliette \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare.\r\nActuellement, le mus\u00e9e permanent de Toone situ\u00e9 au premier \u00e9tage du b\u00e2timent principal se visite gratuitement pendant l\u2019entracte.\r\nL\u2019estaminet folklorique au rez-de-chauss\u00e9e est ouvert tous les jours de 12h00 \u00e0 24h00, sauf le lundi (jour de fermeture).\r\nC\u2019est  un estaminet tricentenaire o\u00f9, dans une ambiance authentique de briques roses espagnoles, poutres noircies et sol dall\u00e9, vous pourrez appr\u00e9cier quelques bi\u00e8res, dont la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gueuze. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Poppentheater Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Traditioneel marionettentheater Brusselse folklore - Typisch Staminee.\r\nMuseum van Toone: Gratis toegang voor het publiek tijdens de pauze.\r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone in Brussel is een origineel en authentiek poppentheater dat doorspekt is van Brusselse geschiedenis en cultuur! \r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone zet sinds 1830 de eeuwenoude traditie van het volkse Theater voort.\r\nDe programmatie is gebaseerd op grote toneelklassiekers zoals \"Cyrano de Bergerac\" van Edmond Rostand, \"De Drie Musketiers\" van Alexandre Dumas, \"Romeo en Julia\" van William Shakespeare en \"Tijl Uilenspiegel\" van Charles De Coster. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"During the Spanish occupation of the Netherlands all theaters were closed to prevent the actors from raising satirical pieces against the Spanish rulers. As a result, doll shows came into play: it was easier to tolerate the fierce dialogues when pronounced by lifeless dolls. About 1830 Antoine \"Toone\" Genty opened  a puppet theater, then in the Marolles. More than 180 years later, this popular entertainment has grown into a Royal Puppet Theater. After Genty, his (unrelated) successors would also be called Toone (Antoine).\r\nThe classics are performed in the local Brussels dialect with wooden puppets (the so-called poechenel), sometimes in Dutch or in French. The puppet theater and museum has been located near the Grand Place for four decades. The theater is located on the upper floors of the building, on the ground floor there is a pub. The museum contains old dolls, including 19th century specimens.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Marionettentheater - Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"W\u00e4hrend der spanischen Besetzung der Niederlande wurden zwangsweise s\u00e4mtliche Theater geschlossen, um Kritik - in Form von satirischen St\u00fccken - an den spanischen Herrschern zu unterbinden. Die Br\u00fcsseler haben alsdann die Schauspieler durch Marionetten (\"Poechenelles\" in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart) ersetzt, die in illegalen Theatern auftragen. \r\nAnfang des 19. Jahrhunderts z\u00e4hlten die Br\u00fcsseler Marionettentheater zu den beliebtesten Vergn\u00fcgungen f\u00fcr Erwachsene, denn sie boten eine enorme Freiheit, ben\u00f6tigen nur wenig finanzielle Mittel und konnten \u00fcberall aufgef\u00fchrt werden. Ihr Repertoire ist bis heute sehr vielf\u00e4ltig und