mente restaurata seguendo scrupolosamente le strutture originali.\r\n\r\nDa non perdere.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Villa Empain, Fundaci\u00f3n Boghossian","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Villa Empain es un testigo destacado de la arquitectura Art d\u00e9co.\r\nConstruida a principios de los a\u00f1os 1930 y ubicada en el centro de la capital europea, se ha convertido en un Centro de Arte y de Di\u00e1logo imprescindible.\u00a0\r\n\r\nEs igualmente la sede internacional de la Fundaci\u00f3n Boghossian, que trabaja en distintos pa\u00edses desde el a\u00f1o 1992. Declarado monumento en el a\u00f1o 2007, ha sido restaurando siguiendo los criterios del edificio original.\u00a0A fecha de hoy, alberga diferentes exposiciones y actividades.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/