is al meer dan 20 jaar lang h\u00e9t Ukkelse theatercaf\u00e9 bij uitstek en kan ondertussen uitpakken met een indrukwekkende lijst aan gastoptredens. Grote sterren uit de Franse cultuur zoals Adamo, Philip Catherine en Maurane gaven hier ooit het beste van zichzelf. Gouden herinneringen voor wie er toen bij was, en petit comit\u00e9. C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village is echter meer dan dat. Hier worden de artiesten en humoristen van morgen geboren dankzij intensieve stages en opleidingen volgens de befaamde Actors Studio\u00a9-methode. Deze charismatische plek met een missie zal je zeker bekoren.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":"+32 2 346 78 38","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717\/A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":" \u2018C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village\u2019, the landmark caf\u00e9 and theatre in Uccle is celebrating its 20th birthday\r\nTwenty years of \u2018evenings among friends\u2019, dedicated to helping local artists meet their audience (allowing them to wander freely through the art) and dedicated to welcoming artists of great calibre, with improbable duos such as Nilda Fernandez and Adamo or Arielle Dombasle and Philippe Katerine. Dedicated, too, to artists who have passed on, such as Georges Moustaki, Michel Delpech and Maurane.\r\nIt also aims to train the artists of tomorrow with the l\u2019\u00c9cole de Th\u00e9\u00e2tre M\u00e9thode Actors Studio\u00a9.\u2019","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"i