i envahira le Studio CityGate. Pr\u00e9vente des tickets: Cin\u00e9ma Nova, de 18-22h (jusqu'au 18\/11).","longdescr":"Pink Night est la soir\u00e9e de cl\u00f4ture de Pink Screens, festival de films queer de Bruxelles, organis\u00e9 par @Genres d'\u00e0 C\u00f4t\u00e9. Pink Night est pour les festivaliers et les non-festivaliers, straight-friendly et un endroit s\u00fbr pour les LGBTQ+. Nous acceptons tout le monde pour ce qu'il est. Vous pouvez \u00eatre qui vous voulez.","performers":"**Disket_dj\r\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/disket_dj\/\r\n**DIDI ( Portugal )\r\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/iamdidibee\/\r\n**PRINZESSIN VS ZOULOU feat Sweet Little Merman (La Gar\u00e7onni\u00e8re Prod)\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mixcloud.com\/PrinzessinBxl\/\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mixcloud.com\/zoulou-choco\/\r\n**Les Supers-Viseurs https:\/\/www.mixcloud.com\/LesSupersViseurs\/\r\n**Azo\r\nhttps:\/\/soundcloud.com\/azodance","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.gdac.org","email":"info@gdac.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"},"nl":{"name":"PINK NIGHT : Closing party of the 21st Pink Screens Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"},"en":{"name":"PINK NIGHT : Closing party of the 21st Pink Screens Festival","shortdescr":"Get your glow on and brighten up your night with beams of beauty and frantic dancing on 19 November! Join the legendary Pink Screens closing party \u2013 and an incredible queer line-up taking over the Studio CityGate. Presales: Cin\u00e9ma Nova, 6-11pm (until 18\/11).","longdescr":"Pink Night is the closing party of Pink Screens, Brussels queer film festival, organised by @Genres d'\u00e0 C\u00f4t\u00e9. Pink Night is for festivalgoers and non-festivalgoers, straight-friendly and a safe place for LGBTQ+. We accept everyone for who they are. You can be whomever you dream.","performers":"**Disket_dj\r\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/disket_dj\/\r\n**DIDI ( Portugal )\r\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/iamdidibee\/\r\n**PRINZESSIN VS ZOULOU feat Sweet Little Merman (La Gar\u00e7onni\u00e8re Prod)\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mixcloud.com\/PrinzessinBxl\/\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mixcloud.com\/zoulou-choco\/\r\n**Les Supers-Viseurs https:\/\/www.mixcloud.com\/LesSupersViseurs\/\r\n**Azo\r\nhttps:\/\/soundcloud.com\/azodance","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"},"de":{"name":"PINK NIGHT : Closing party of the 21st Pink Screens Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"},"it":{"name":"PINK NIGHT : Closing party of the 21st Pink Screens Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"},"sp":{"name":"PINK NIGHT : Closing party of the 21st Pink Screens Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"},"pt":{"name":"PINK NIGHT : Closing party of the 21st Pink Screens Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"},"cn":{"name":"PINK NIGHT : Closing party of the 21st Pink Screens Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545584"}},"place":{"id":269710,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Studio CityGate","address_street_name":"Rue des Goujons","address_street_number":"152","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@studiocitygate.be","website":"http:\/\/www.studiocitygate.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue des Goujons, 152","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Le b\u00e2timent se divise en deux ailes, A et B, et \u00e0 chaque \u00e9tage d'entre elle son p\u00f4le. L'opportunit\u00e9 pour des cr\u00e9atifs, commer\u00e7ants, associations et acteurs innovants de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier d'un espace accessible \u00e0 m\u00eame de leur permettre d'\u00e9panouir leur activit\u00e9 dans un cadre dynamique et riche de diversit\u00e9. Situ\u00e9 \u00e0 10 minutes de la Gare du Midi, le Studio CityGate s\u2019int\u00e8gre dans le vaste programme CityGate qui se d\u00e9cline en trois sites (CityGate I, II et III). Cet am\u00e9nagement urbain redonne des couleurs au quartier sur une superficie totale de plus de 90.000 m\u00b2.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Studio CityGate","address_street_name":"Grondelsstraat","address_street_number":"152","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@studiocitygate.be","website":"http:\/\/www.studiocitygate.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Grondelsstraat, 152","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Het gebouw is verdeeld in twee vleugels, A en B, en elke verdieping herbergt verschillende activiteitszones. Een uitgelezen mogelijkheid voor creatievelingen, handelaars, verenigingen en innovatieve spelers om te profiteren van een toegankelijke ruimte om hen in staat te stellen hun bedrijf te laten floreren in een dynamisch kader rijk in diversiteit. Studio Citygate ligt op 10 minuten van het Zuidstation en maakt deel uit van het Citygate-programma, dat is verdeeld in drie locaties (Citygate I, II en III). Dit stadsontwerp geeft de wijk kleur op een totale oppervlakte van meer dan 90.000 m\u00b2.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Studio CityGate","address_street_name":"Rue des Goujons","address_street_number":"152","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@studiocitygate.be","website":"http:\/\/www.studiocitygate.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue des Goujons, 152","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"The building is divided into two wings, A and B, and each floor has its own centre. It's an opportunity for creative people, shopkeepers, associations and innovative actors to benefit from an accessible space that will allow them to develop their activity in a dynamic and diverse environment. Located 10 minutes from Brussels South Station, CityGate Studio is part of the vast CityGate programme, which is spread over three sites (CityGate I, II and III). This urban development brings colour to the district and covers an area of more than 90,000m\u00b2. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Studio Citygate","address_street_name":"Rue des Goujons","address_street_number":"152","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@studiocitygate.be","website":"http:\/\/www.studiocitygate.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue des Goujons, 152","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Studio Citygate","