29710,"location":{"lat":50.83240372,"lon":4.32169923},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-11-15T09:05:05+01:00","published_at":"2017-08-25T14:57:57+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":242526,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gdac.org","website":"http:\/\/www.gdac.org","phone_contact":"+32 474 37 50 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Genres d\u2019\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 est une asbl qui existe depuis 2001. Son but : promouvoir les sexualit\u00e9s et les genres diff\u00e9rents. Comment : essentiellement en envahissant les salles obscures et en s\u2019emparant du grand \u00e9cran. Ses activit\u00e9s principales sont donc directement ancr\u00e9es dans l\u2019univers cin\u00e9matographique, un univers d\u2019o\u00f9 elle se pla\u00eet \u00e0 bouleverser les repr\u00e9sentations norm\u00e9es et les cases \u00e9tablies.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gdac.org","website":"http:\/\/www.gdac.org","phone_contact":"+32 474 37 50 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Genres d\u2019\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 is een vereniging die werd opgericht in 2001! Haar doel : het promoten van een gediversifieerd beeld rond seksualiteit en gender in al zijn vormen. Hoe? Vooral door donkere zalen in te trekken en daar het grote scherm te veroveren. Haar voornaamste activiteiten zijn direct verankerd in het filmuniversum, een universum waarin ze enthousiast de clich\u00e9s en hokjes doorbreekt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gdac.org","website":"http:\/\/www.gdac.org","phone_contact":"+32 474 37 50 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Genres d\u2019\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 was created in 2001! Its goal: to promote alternative sexuality and gender. How: essentially by invading cinema halls and taking over the big screen. Its main activities are directly rooted in the world of cinema, a world where it likes to overturn the standardised performances and established check boxes.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gdac.org","website":"http:\/\/www.gdac.org","phone_contact":"+32 474 37 50 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gdac.org","website":"http:\/\/www.gdac.org","phone_contact":"+32 474 37 50 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Genres d'\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9","address_street_na