 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort