ns":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[3,11],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 3-6 ans","Famille"],"nl":["Kinderen 3-6 j.","Familie"],"en":["Children 3-6 yr.","Family"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T21:36:16+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-16T10:13:59+02:00","backoffice_id":262030,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":542070,"date_start":"2022-11-20","date_end":"2022-11-20","date_next":"2022-11-20","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen"}},"others":{"list":[95],"translations":{"fr":["Patrimoine"],"nl":["Erfgoed"],"en":["Heritage"],"de":["Kulturerbe"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Journ\u00e9e des Arts pour Enfants : Magical theatres","shortdescr":"Journ\u00e9e famille dans l'expo Magical Theatres avec des ateliers en continu, un parcours de contes, un bar familial au grenier et un superbe spectacle : Diorama.  Pour les familles avec enfants de 4 \u00e0 10 ans.","longdescr":"en collaboration avec Hanafubuki\r\n\r\nEntrez dans le monde magique du petit th\u00e9\u00e2tre en papier. Visitez l'expo 'Magical Theatres' avec un audioguide sp\u00e9cial enfant & d\u00e9couvrez l'intrigante Porte de Hal. \u00c0 chaque \u00e9tage de cette porte m\u00e9di\u00e9vale (ou est-ce un ch\u00e2teau ?), il y a quelque chose \u00e0 faire !\r\n\r\nEn continu 10:30 - 16:30 :\r\n\r\nAteliers\r\n1. Fabrique ton pop-up. Choisis, colorie, coupe et colle : les 4 C pour r\u00e9ussir un th\u00e9\u00e2tre en papier en 3D !\r\n2. Fabrique ton mobile. Par exemple un animal fabuleux pour mettre au-dessus de ton lit. On est d'accord : toutes les chambres d'enfant ont besoin d'un dragon cracheur de feu !?\r\n3. Fabrique tes marionnettes de doigt. 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 doigts font 5 jolies petites marionnettes en feutre ! Maman, papy, tantine, fr\u00e9rot et le chien. Et qu'en est-il de mamy, soeurette, papa, le poisson rouge et le b\u00e9b\u00e9 ? 6, 7, 8, 9, 10 !\r\n4. Fabrique un th\u00e9\u00e2tre tournant. Je partais \u00e0 l'aventure et j'ai crois\u00e9 un ours ! Nous sommes devenus amis et une gu\u00eape est arriv\u00e9e et alors... Peut-\u00eatre un apr\u00e8s-midi th\u00e9 et des feux d'artifice ou autre chose ? Dessine ton histoire et joue les sc\u00e8nes dans ton th\u00e9\u00e2tre de papier miniature. \r\n\r\nParcours de contes\r\nLe chat bott\u00e9, Cendrillon, ou Aladin : choisis ton livre (ou choisis les tous) et pars enqu\u00eater dans l'exposition Magical Theaters. Dans chaque livre, se trouve une chouette histoire \u00e0 lire, des missions et un personnage \u00e0 colorier et d\u00e9couper.\r\n\r\nBar familial\r\nRendez-vous au grenier pour vous reposer, discuter et profiter d'une boisson et d'un en-cas. Attention : pendant la repr\u00e9sentation, le bar sera temporairement ferm\u00e9. \r\n\r\nSur inscription le jour-m\u00eame - Repr\u00e9sentation Diorama (Hanafubuki) :  \r\nTout commence un matin bizarre, quand un soleil carr\u00e9 appara\u00eet !\r\nHanafubuki joue une petite perle, le public\u00e9tant proche de son mini th\u00e9\u00e2tre en bois. De son coffre de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, apparaissent des formes abstraites, des d\u00e9cors, des animaux et des personnages. En tant que spectateur, vous faites un voyage \u00e0 travers cette bo\u00eete d'observation pliable. Diorama est un bijou, un petit th\u00e9\u00e2tre de table qui transporte petits et moins petits dans une fantaisie d\u00e9brid\u00e9e !\r\nLe spectacle dure 30 minutes. Les places \u00e9tant limit\u00e9es, vous pouvez vous inscrire \u00e0 l'accueil de la Porte de Hal le jour-m\u00eame pour l'une des repr\u00e9sentations suivantes : 10h30 (FR) - 11h30 (NL) - 14h00 (FR) - 15h30 (NL).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.hallegatemuseum.be\/fr\/agenda-0","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"},"nl":{"name":"Kunstendag voor Kinderen: Magical theatres","shortdescr":"Gezinsdag i.k.v. de expo Magical Theatres met inloopateliers, verhalenparcours, familiebar op zolder en een geweldige voorstelling: Diorama. Voor families met kinderen van 4 t.e.m. 10 jaar.","longdescr":"i.s.m. Hanafubuki\r\n\r\nStap in de magische wereld van het papieren miniatuurtheater. Bezoek de expo Magical Theatres met een audiogids op kindermaat & ontdek de Hallepoort. Op elke verdieping van deze middeleeuwse  stadspoort (of is het toch een kasteeltje?) valt wat te beleven!\r\n\r\nDoorlopend 10:30 \u2013 16:30: \r\n\r\nInloopateliers\r\n1.Maak een tunnelboek. Kiezen, kleuren, knippen en kleven: de vier K\u2019s voor een geslaagd 3D-theatertje uit papier!\r\n2.Maak een mobieltje. Bijvoorbeeld een fabeldier voor boven je bed. Want zeg nu zelf: elke kinderkamer heeft toch een vuurspuwende draak nodig!?\r\n3.Maak vingerpopjes. 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 vingers maakt 5 schattige vingerpopjes uit vilt! Mama, opa, tante, broer en de hond. En wat dan met oma, zus, papa, de goudvis en Poppejans? 6, 7, 8, 9, 10!\r\n4.Maak een draaitheater. Eerst ging ik op avontuur en toen kwam ik een beer tegen! En we werden vriend en dan kwam er een wesp en toen \u2026 Misschien nog een theekransje en vuurwerk  ofzo? Teken je verhaal en laat de sc\u00e8nes draaien in je eigen mini-papiertheatertje. \r\n\r\nVerhalenparcours\r\nDe Gelaarsde Kat, Assepoester, of Aladdin: kies je theaterboekje (of kies ze allemaal) en ga op onderzoek in de tentoonstellling Magical Theatres. In elk boekje vind je een leuk verhaal om te lezen, zoekopdrachtjes en een personage om in te kleuren en uit te knippen.   \r\n\r\nFamiliebar\r\nKom uitblazen, napraten en plannen maken op zolder en geniet van een hapje en een drankje. Opgelet: tijdens de voorstelling sluit de bar even. \r\n\r\nOp inschrijving de dag zelf \u2013 Voorstelling Diorama (Hanafubuki):  \r\nAlles begint op een vreemde ochtend, waar er plots geen ronde maar een vierkante zon opkomt!\r\nHanafubuki speelt een klein pareltje, met het publiek dicht bij hun houten mini-theater. Uit hun theaterkoffer toveren ze abstracte vormen, decors, dieren en personages. Als toeschouwer maak je een reis doorheen deze uitklapbare kijkkast. Diorama is een kleinood, een klein tafeltheater dat klein en minder klein vervoert in ongebreidelde fantasie!\r\nDe voorstelling duurt 30 min. Plaatsen zijn beperkt, daarom kan je je bij aankomst aan het onthaal registeren voor \u00e9\u00e9n van de spelmomenten: 10.30 (FR) \u2013 11.30 (NL) \u2013 14.00 (FR) \u2013 15.30 (NL).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.hallegatemuseum.be\/nl\/agenda-0","email":"public@kmkg-mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"},"en":{"name":"Kids' Art Day: Magical theatres","shortdescr":"Family day in the exhibition Magical Theatres featuring walk-in workshops, story trail, family bar in the attic and a wonderful show: Diorama.  For families with children aged 4 to 10.","longdescr":"in collaboration with Hanafubuki\r\n\r\nStep into the magical world of the miniature paper theatre. Visit the exhibition \"Magical Theatres\" with an audio guide written specially for children & discover the impressive medieval Halle Gate. There is something to experience on every floor!\r\n\r\nFamily day with walk-in workshops, story trail, family bar in the attic and a great show: Diorama.  For families with children aged 4 to 10.\r\n\r\nContinuous 10:30 - 16:30: \r\n\r\nWalk-in workshops\r\n1.Make a tunnel book. Choose, colour, cut and glue is all you need to do!\r\n2.Make a mobile that you can hang above your bed. Choose for example the shape of a fabulous fantastic beast because, let's face it: every child's room needs a fire-breathing dragon, right!?\r\n3.Make finger puppets. 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 fingers makes 5 cute finger puppets out of felt! Mum, grandad, auntie, brother and the dog. And what about grandma, sister, dad, the goldfish and the baby? 6, 7, 8, 9, 10!\r\n4.Make a rotating theatre. First I went on an adventure and then I met a bear! And we became friends and then came a nasty wasp and then ... Maybe a tea party and some fireworks? Draw your story and make the scenes turn in your own miniature paper theatre. \r\n\r\nStory trail\r\nPuss in Boots, Cinderella, or Aladdin: choose your theatre booklet (or choose them all) and explore the Magical Theatres exhibition. In each booklet, you will find a fun story to read, quests and a character to colour in and cut out.   \r\n\r\nFamily bar\r\nMeet you in the attic for a little rest and something small to eat or drink.  Please note that the bar closes briefly during the performance. \r\n\r\nRegister on the day itself - Performance Diorama (Hanafubuki):  \r\n\r\nEverything starts on a strange morning, where suddenly not a round but a square sun rises!\r\n\r\nHanafubuki plays a little gem, with the audience sitting close to their wooden mini-theatre. From their theatre case, they conjure abstract shapes, sets, animals and characters. As a spectator, you take a journey through this fold-out viewing box. Diorama is a fragile treasure, a small table theatre that transports the little ones and the not so little ones into unbridled fantasy!\r\nThe performance lasts 30 min and is alternatingly performed in Dutch and French. Places are limited, so on arrival at the reception desk you can register for one of the time slots: 10:30 (FR) \u2013 11:30 (NL) \u2013 14:00 (FR) \u2013 15:30 (NL).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.hallegatemuseum.be\/en\/agenda","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"},"de":{"name":"Kunstendag voor kinderen: Magical theatres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"},"it":{"name":"Kunstendag voor kinderen: Magical theatres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"},"sp":{"name":"Kunstendag voor kinderen: Magical theatres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"},"pt":{"name":"Kunstendag voor kinderen: Magical theatres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"},"cn":{"name":"Kunstendag voor kinderen: Magical theatres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542070"}},"place":{"id":203657,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ce monument f\u00e9erique, vieux de plus de 600 ans, constitue le t\u00e9moin le plus remarquable du pass\u00e9 m\u00e9di\u00e9val de la ville.\r\nDernier vestige de la seconde enceinte de Bruxelles, la porte de Hal accueille aujourd\u2019hui une belle collection d\u2019\u0153uvres et de multiples supports didactiques mettant en lumi\u00e8re son histoire et celle des fortifications bruxelloises. La fa\u00e7ade n\u00e9ogothique et la haute toiture ajout\u00e9es par l\u2019architecte Henry Beyaert au XIXe si\u00e8cle n\u2019ont rien enlev\u00e9 \u00e0 la splendeur des salles m\u00e9di\u00e9vales \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur du b\u00e2timent. Au sommet de la tour, depuis le chemin de ronde cr\u00e9nel\u00e9, vous pourrez profiter d\u2019un spectaculaire panorama sur Bruxelles et sa r\u00e9gion. Une visite id\u00e9ale pour enfants et adultes.","description_print":"Ce monument f\u00e9\u00e9rique, vieux de plus de 600 ans, constitue le t\u00e9moin le plus remarquable du pass\u00e9 m\u00e9di\u00e9val de la ville. Dernier vestige de la seconde enceinte de Bruxelles, la porte de Hal accueille aujourd\u2019hui une belle collection d\u2019\u0153uvres et de multiples supports didactiques mettant en lumi\u00e8re son histoire et celle des fortifications bruxelloises. La fa\u00e7ade n\u00e9ogothique et la haute toiture ajout\u00e9es par l\u2019architecte Henry Beyaert au XIXe si\u00e8cle n\u2019ont rien enlev\u00e9 \u00e0 la splendeur des salles m\u00e9di\u00e9vales \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur du b\u00e2timent. Au sommet de la tour, depuis le chemin de ronde cr\u00e9nel\u00e9, vous pourrez profiter d\u2019un spectaculaire panorama sur Bruxelles et sa r\u00e9gion. Une visite id\u00e9ale pour enfants et adultes.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Hallepoort \u2013 KMKG","address_street_name":"Zuidlaan","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallepoortmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zuidlaan, 150","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De Hallepoort is een sprookjesachtig monument, meer dan 600 jaar oud en de meest opmerkelijke getuige van het middeleeuwse verleden van de stad Brussel.\r\nDe Hallepoort is het laatste overblijfsel van de tweede omwalling van Brussel. Vandaag vind je er een prachtige collectie kunstwerken en vele didactische hulpmiddelen rond de geschiedenis van de Brusselse omwallingen en de stedelijke ambachtsgilden.\r\nDe neogotische fa\u00e7ade en het hoge dak, toegevoegd door architect Henry Beyaert in de 19de eeuw hebben niets afgedaan aan de pracht van de middeleeuwse zalen binnenin het gebouw.\r\nBoven op de toren kan je genieten van een spectaculair panorama over Brussel en omgeving.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halle Gate \u2013 RMAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kmkg-mrah.be\/halle-gate","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This last preserved gate will catapult you centuries back. An interactive tour through the striking rooms of the 14th century city gate will reveal how Brussels defended itself against external attacks during the Middle Ages and present the role that townspeople played in defence of their city. Visitors will gain a better understanding of the medieval city and its impact on present-day metropolitan Brussels by trying on a piece of armour, checking out models and short films,  exploring multimedia activities or just simply admiring the beautiful selection of museum pieces.\r\nAnd, the changing temporary exhibits on past and current life in the city are always a great reason to return to the Halle Gate. Best of all, the crenellated walkway around the top of the monument offers a spectacular view of the sprawling capital.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Porte de Hal - K\u00f6nigliche Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das ehemalige Stadttor Porte de Hal ist einer der bemerkenswertesten Zeugen der mittelalterlichen Vergangenheit Br\u00fcssels: Es handelt sich um das einzige noch erhaltene Tor der sieben Stadttore der mittelalterlichen Festungsmauern.\r\n\r\nFestung mit bewegter Vergangenheit: Das heute wie eine verwunschene Burg anmutende Geb\u00e4ude blickt auf eine bewegte Geschichte zur\u00fcck und war mehrfach vom Abriss bedroht: Nach der milit\u00e4rischen Funktion bis zum Jahr 1564 folgten verschiedenste Arten der Nutzung - unter anderem als lutherische Kirche, als Kontrollstelle f\u00fcr die Wareneinfuhr und -ausfuhr, als Kornspeicher und als Archiv! \r\n\r\nDas Museum Porte de Hal: 1847 wird das Geb\u00e4ude erstmals als Museum genutzt, 1860 wird der Architekt Henri Beyaert offiziell mit dem Umbau beauftragt: Er nimmt tiefgreifende bauliche Ver\u00e4nderungen und Neuinterpretation im neogotischen Stil vor. Vorherrschend ist die romantische Vision eines mittelalterlichen Bauwerks mit T\u00fcrmchen, Zinnen, Scharten, Verzierungen und verschiedenen dekorativen Elementen. \r\n\r\nHeute verbirgt sich hinter der renovierten wei\u00dfen Fassade das Museum \u201eMus\u00e9e du Porte de Hal\" mit Sammlungen \u00fcber das mittelalterliche Br\u00fcssel und die Geschichte des Geb\u00e4udes, die naturgem\u00e4\u00df eng miteinander verkn\u00fcpft sind. \r\n\r\nBesonderer Tipp: Vom Turm aus haben Sie einen fantastischen Ausblick auf Br\u00fcssel. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Porte de Hal - Musei Reali d'Arte e Storia, Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Edificio che risale a oltre 600 anni fa in stile neogotico ottimamente conservato, la Porte de hal \u00e8 il monumento pi\u00f9 importante del passato medievale della citt\u00e0.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEdificio che risale a oltre 600 anni fa in stile neogotico ottimamente conservato, la Porte de hal \u00e8 il monumento pi\u00f9 importante del passato medievale della citt\u00e0.\u00a0Si tratta dell'unica porta fortificata della seconda cinta delle\u00a0mura Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nLa funzione di prigione la risparmi\u00f2 dalla demolizione delle porte del XVIII secolo. Tuttavia, nel 1869, l'architetto Beyaert realizz\u00f2 alcune modifiche alterandone l'aspetto iniziale che nulla tolgono allo splendore delle sale medievali interne.\u00a0Dall'alto della torre si gode un bel<b> panorama su Bruxelles.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa Porte de Hal oggi accoglie una bella collezione di opere che, con l'aiuto di supporti didattici, mettono in luce la sua storia e quella delle fortificazioni brussellesi.\u00a0\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Puerta de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.laguiadeviaje.com\/puerta-de-hal\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Puerta de Hal, en los Museos Reales de Arte y de Historia, es un monumento de m\u00e1s de 600 a\u00f1os, que constituye el testigo m\u00e1s destacado del medievo en Bruselas.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa Puerta de Hal, en los Museos Reales de Arte y de Historia, es un monumento de m\u00e1s de 600 a\u00f1os, que constituye el testigo m\u00e1s destacado del medievo en Bruselas.\r\n\r\n\u00daltimo vestigio de la segunda muralla de Bruselas, la Puerta de Hal, alberga a fecha de hoy una magn\u00edfica colecci\u00f3n de obras de arte y m\u00faltiples soportes did\u00e1cticos, que ponen de relieve su historia y la de las fortificaciones bruselenses.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa fachada neog\u00f3tica y los altos techos a\u00f1adidos por el arquitecto Henry Beyaert en el s. XIX no han acabado con el esplendor de las salas medievales en el interior del edificio.\r\n\r\nEn lo alto de la torre, desde el camino de ronda almenado, podr\u00e1s disfrutar de unas vistas espectaculares de Bruselas y de su regi\u00f3n.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":414,"location":{"lat":50.83309758,"lon":4.34491654},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-18T10:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":61,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Embarquez pour un fascinant voyage \u00e0 travers l'art et l'histoire. Venez fl\u00e2ner parmi les momies \u00e9gyptiennes et les silex pr\u00e9historiques, vous promener entre les verres anciens et prendre du recul pour mieux contempler d'impressionnantes tapisseries m\u00e9di\u00e9vales. Venez vous immerger dans le monde oriental en croisant des Bouddhas d'Asie et voyager jusqu'\u00e0 l'autre bout de la terre pour apercevoir une gigantesque statue de l'\u00eele de P\u00e2ques. La magnifique collection d'Art Nouveau vous attend au bout du voyage.\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s.\r\n\r\n\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s. ","description_print":"Le Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire illustre les activit\u00e9s humaines et artistiques des cinq continents \u2013 hormis l\u2019Afrique noire \u2013, de la Pr\u00e9histoire \u00e0 nos jours. Les collections remplissent quatre b\u00e2timents et sont regroup\u00e9es en quatre d\u00e9partements: l\u2019Antiquit\u00e9, les civilisations extra-europ\u00e9ennes, l\u2019arch\u00e9ologie nationale et les arts d\u00e9coratifs europ\u00e9ens.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis (KMKG)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kmkg.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Maak een wereldreis door de geschiedenis! Wandel van prehistorische vuistbijlen naar Egyptische mummies. Snuistert tussen betoverende glas en zet een stap achteruit om de indrukwekkende Brusselse wandtapijten te bekijken. Ga de oosterse toer op tussen de Aziatische boeddha\u2019s en steek de Atlantische Oceaan over om Kuifjes \u2018beeldje met het gebroken oor\u2019. En dan is er nog de mooie collectie van Belgische art nouveau\u2026 U komt ogen en oren te kort!\r\n\r\nHet Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis maakt deel uit van de Koninklijke Musea voor Kunst en Geschiedenis (KMKG) die ook het Muziekinstrumentenmuseum (MIM), de Hallepoort en de Musea van het Verre Oosten (gesloten voor renovatie) bundelen.","description_print":"Het Jubelparkmuseum kan bogen op een imposante collectie kunstschatten en archeologische vondsten afkomstig uit de vijf continenten \u2013 met uitzondering van Zwart-Afrika \u2013 van de prehistorie tot op heden. De verzamelingen vullen vier gebouwen en zijn ingedeeld in evenveel departementen: Oudheid (het Nabije Oosten, Egypte, Griekenland, Rome en Byzantium), Niet-Europese Beschavingen (Islam, Azi\u00eb, Polynesi\u00eb & Micronesi\u00eb en Amerika), Nationale Archeologie en Europese Sierkunsten.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & History Museum (RMAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Embark on a fascinating journey through art and history! Come and stroll among the prehistoric flints and Egyptian mummies, walk between the ancient glasses and stand back to contemplate the impressive medieval tapestries. Immerse yourself in the oriental world as you pass Asian Buddhas and travel to the other side of the world to see a gigantic statue from Easter Island. You still have to admire the magnificent collection of Belgian Art Nouveau...\r\n\r\nThe Art & History Museum is part of the Royal Museums of Art and History (RMAH) that also cover the Musical Instruments Museum (MIM), Halle Gate and the Museums of the Far East (currently closed for renovation).","description_print":"The Cinquantenaire Museum is the headquarters of the Royal Museums of Art and History. It was erected at the end of the nineteenth century and is one of the most extensive museums in Belgium. The collections are divided according to four main themes: 1) National Archaeology; 2) Antiquity; 3) European Decorative Art; 4) Non-European Civilizations.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Cinquantenaire-Museum, gelegen im Br\u00fcsseler Jubelpark, ist Teil der K\u00f6niglichen Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte und bietet einen umfassenden und vielseitigen \u00dcberblick \u00fcber die Geschichte von den Hochkulturen der Antike bis hin zu den Kunststr\u00f6mungen der Gegenwart.\r\n\r\nAntike Sammlungen: \r\nDie antiken Sammlungen befassen sich mit den untergegangenen Hochkulturen von \u00c4gypten (Neuheit: das Grabmal von Nakht), Mesopotamien, Griechenland und Rom. Gezeigt werden au\u00dferdem die gro\u00dfen Kunststr\u00f6mungen Europas vom 10. Jahrhundert bis heute. Wandteppiche, Altaraufs\u00e4tze, Spitze, Goldschmiedekunst und Porzellan geh\u00f6ren zu den kostbaren H\u00f6hepunkten der Ausstellung.\r\n\r\nVon Mikronesien bis Amerika: \r\nDie nicht-europ\u00e4ischen Werke laden ihrerseits auf eine Reise ein: nach Mikronesien, Polynesien, Indien, S\u00fcdostasien, China und ins pr\u00e4kolumbische Amerika. In den eindrucksvollen Arch\u00e4ologie-S\u00e4len wird der Geschichte der Region von der Vorgeschichte bis zur Epoche der Merowinger neues Leben eingehaucht.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Arte & Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situato nel cuore del complesso del Cinquantenario, il Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire vi invita a viaggiatore attraverso i continenti dalla Preistoria al XX secolo. \r\n\r\n\r\nLe sue ricche collezioni sono suddivise in quattro grandi sezioni :\r\n\r\n- L'Antichit\u00e0 dove sono presentate le grandi civilt\u00e0 scomparse dell'Egitto, della Mesopotamia, della Grecia e di Roma.\r\n- Le Arti decorative europee dove scoprire le correnti artistiche dal X secolo ai giorni nostri.\r\n- Le Civilt\u00e0 non europee che invitano al viaggio: India, Sudest asiatico, Cina, America precolombiana.\r\n- L'archeologia nazionale per rivivere il passato delle nostre regioni, dalla Preistoria al periodo merovingio.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo de Arte e Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ad\u00e9ntrate en este edificio hist\u00f3rico, uno de los mayores museos de B\u00e9lgica erigido por el anterior rey belga Leopoldo II. Descubre una gran cantidad de objetos desde la prehistoria hasta la antig\u00fcedad y de las artes aplicadas europeas hasta una amplia colecci\u00f3n de arte no europea. Explora todo, incluyendo las interesantes exposiciones temporales, conferencias y otras actividades. Desafortunadamente, la p\u00e1gina web no es tan amplia como para mostrar toda nuestra colecci\u00f3n, compuesta por miles de tesoros del arte y objetos hist\u00f3ricos. Sin embargo, esperamos que nos visites y disfrutes descubriendo o redescubriendo el inmenso patrimonio que gestionamos y exhibimos. De hecho, para nosotros el arte y la historia no son muerte y temas pasados, si no una viva y constante fuente de inspiraci\u00f3n y diversi\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nEl Museo de Arte e Historia es parte de los Museos Reales de Arte e Historia(MRAH), que incluye el Museo de Instrumentos Musicales(MIM), la Puerta de Hal y los Museos del Lejano Oriente(recientemente cerrado por renovaciones).\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Da arqueologia nacional \u00e0s artes decorativas europeias, passando pela antiguidade cl\u00e1ssica e pelas civiliza\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o europeias, embarque numa fascinante viagem atrav\u00e9s da arte e da hist\u00f3ria num edif\u00edcio magn\u00edfico criado por L\u00e9opold II no parque do Cinquenten\u00e1rio em Bruxelas.\r\n\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio muda de pele e torna-se o Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria!\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio desenvolveu um trabalho de reflex\u00e3o sobre a sua imagem. Este resultou numa campanha de reorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o global da institui\u00e7\u00e3o. Come\u00e7ou assim uma reconquista museogr\u00e1fica: a decis\u00e3o de organizar exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias baseadas nas pr\u00f3prias cole\u00e7\u00f5es do museu e de renovar progressivamente as salas permanentes, come\u00e7ando pelo armaz\u00e9m Wolfers, que foi a primeira etapa de uma s\u00e9rie de outras renova\u00e7\u00f5es (salas Egito, salas s\u00e9culos XIX e XX, maqueta de Roma\u2026) que atingem rapidamente a sua velocidade de cruzeiro. O\r\n- Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria pertence aos Museus Reais de Arte e da Hist\u00f3ria, que englobam, para al\u00e9m deste, o MIM (Museu dos Instrumentos Musicais), a Porta de Hal e os Museus do Extremo Oriente, atualmente encerrados.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12,"location":{"lat":50.83935087,"lon":4.3917188},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-18T10:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/66929ce19f5f9e85b5901d77cbdcb1d7c1593547.jpg","width":5161,"height":4058,"ratio":1.27,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Journ\u00e9e des Arts pour Enfants : Magical theatres","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Journ\u00e9e des Arts pour Enfants : Magical theatres","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Journ\u00e9e des Arts pour Enfants : Magical theatres","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-11-20","doors":"10:00:00","start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"}},"value":12}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[3,4,11],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 3-6 ans","Enfants 6-9 ans","Famille"],"nl":["Kinderen 3-6 j.","Kinderen 6-9 j.","Familie"],"en":["Children 3-6 yr.","Children 6-9 yr.","Family"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[252,255,256,257,259,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour les personnes aveugles et malvoyantes","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-18T10:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-16T14:17:24+02:00","backoffice_id":262070,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":544847,"date_start":"2022-11-20","date_end":"2022-11-20","date_next":"2022-11-20","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert au Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Avec Moi et le Th\u00e9o\/Ik en den Theo vous (re) d\u00e9couvrez le monde \u00e0 travers les yeux des petits. Enfants, parents et grands-parents marchent comme des robots, jouent \u00e0 la chaise musicale, re\u00e7oivent un souffle \u00e9nergique de l\u2019oncle Jazz, jouent de l\u2019air guitar et m\u00eame plus. Bref, ils explorent les limites ext\u00e9rieures de leur fantaisie.\r\n\r\nEn fonction de la composition du public, Moi et le Th\u00e9o\/Ik en den Theo chantent en fran\u00e7ais, en n\u00e9erlandais ou, dans le meilleur des mondes, en deux langues.\r\n\r\nPiet Maris et Theophane Raballand (tous les deux de Jaune Toujours) font leur truc \u00e0 l\u2019accord\u00e9on, \u00e0 la batterie et aux percussions, mais surtout\u2026 avec le public, qui est sans cesse invit\u00e9 \u00e0 danser, \u00e0 chanter, \u00e0 sauter et \u00e0 imaginer.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.jeunessesmusicales.be\/bruxelles\/reservations\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"},"nl":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o in concert op Kasteel Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Bij Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o (her)bekijk je de wereld door kinderogen. Kinderen, ouders en grootouders kunnen rondlopen als robots, stoelendansen, bezoek krijgen van nonkel Jazz, luchtgitaar spelen en nog veel meer... Kortom, ze verkennen de uiterste grenzen van hun fantasie.\r\n\r\nAfhankelijk van de samenstelling van het publiek zingen Ik en den Theo\/Moi et le Th\u00e9o in het Nederlands of in het Frans of, in de beste van alle werelden, in beide talen.\r\n\r\nPiet Maris en Theophane Raballand (allebei van Jaune Toujours) doen hun ding op accordeon en slagwerk ... en met het publiek, dat voortdurend wordt uitgedaagd om mee te zingen, dansen, springen en fantaseren.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"},"en":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert au Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"},"de":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert au Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"},"it":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert au Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"},"sp":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert au Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"},"pt":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert au Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"},"cn":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert au Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544847"}},"place":{"id":2507,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","address_street_name":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese, 3","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Le Karreveld n'est pas qu'un parc mais c'est aussi une \"ferme-ch\u00e2teau\" devenue un espace culturel au centre du parc entour\u00e9 d'arbres et d'un \u00e9tang.\r\n\r\nVous pourrez vous y promener, visiter une exposition, fl\u00e2ner le long des chemins en d\u00e9couvrant ces \u00e9co-syst\u00e8mes.\r\n\r\nAu coeur du parc, ce trouve une ancienne ferme-ch\u00e2teau devenu le lieu des c\u00e9r\u00e9monies officielles de mariages des Molenbeekois mais \u00e9galement un espace culturel accueillant des expositions, concerts, spectacles, march\u00e9 artisanal (March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl), ...","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Karreveldkasteel","address_street_name":"Jean de la Hoeselaan","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Jean de la Hoeselaan, 3","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"\r\nHet Karreveld is niet alleen een park, maar ook een \"kasteelboerderij\" die een culturele ruimte is geworden in het midden van het park, omringd door bomen en een vijver.\r\n\r\nU kunt er rondwandelen, een tentoonstelling bezoeken, over de paden wandelen en deze ecosystemen ontdekken.\r\n\r\nIn het hart van het park bevindt zich een voormalige boerderij-kasteel waar offici\u00eble huwelijksceremonies van de Molenbeekenaars plaatsvinden, maar ook een culturele ruimte waar tentoonstellingen, concerten, voorstellingen, een ambachtsmarkt (kerstmarkt), ... plaatsvinden.\r\n\r\nOm (opnieuw) ontdekt te word","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","address_street_name":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese, 3","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","address_street_name":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese, 3","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Ch\u00e2teau du Karreveld","address_street_name":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Avenue Jean de la Hoese, 3","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":