"en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Tv Moms + Global Charming","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545332"},"nl":{"name":"Tv Moms + Global Charming","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545332"},"en":{"name":"Tv Moms + Global Charming","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"***TV Moms (USA) Gutter Rock n Roll***\r\nTV Moms (New York, NY USA) is a loud, guitar-drums, gutter rocknroll band.\r\nOk, not all the songs are loud. There\u2019s some singing in there, but not\r\nvocal gymnastics. Bummer rock is a thing? But a little more sarcastic.\r\nRiff-based guitar stuff that is really fun to play, even if you don\u2019t play\r\nguitar that much.\r\nhttps:\/\/youtu.be\/JP5-f9eT_M0\r\n--- --- ---\r\n***Global Charming (NL) Jolt Art Punk ***\r\nGlobal Charming exorcise the banality of everyday life, knowing the planet\r\nis doomed and the printer is out of ink again.The group, made up of familiar figures in the Dutch underground scene as musicians, record producers and visual artists, recorded the album at Schenk Studio, Amsterdam.Follow the rhythm of a plate spinning on a tabletop: the acceleration, the\r\nsudden halt. Again, and again, and again.\r\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/...\/UCOlFIhURrjc2...\/videos...\r\n--- --- ---\r\nA partir de 19h30h \/\/ Prix libre\r\nPlease bring CASH!\r\n--- --- --- --- ---\r\nGrilled Cheese \u00e0 manger sur place !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545332"},"de":{"name":"Tv Moms + Global Charming",