:00","backoffice_id":258430,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.8735804647363},{"id":543982,"date_start":"2022-11-24","date_end":"2022-11-26","date_next":"2022-11-24","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"],"de":["Theater"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Nous habiterons le monde, en haut, en bas.\r\n\r\nNos corps danseront, devant, derri\u00e8re.\r\nNos souffles gonfleront les voiles du sensible.\r\nNos gestes imprimeront l'action renouvel\u00e9e.\r\nNos espaces cr\u00e9eront des lieux d'esp\u00e9rance.\r\n\r\nDemain viendra. Et nous nous souvenons d'hier, des anc\u00eatres, des racines, des ancrages, des sagesses et des simplicit\u00e9s.\r\nDemain viendra. Et nous fa\u00e7onnons des r\u00e9cits nouveaux, des chemins de traverse, des \u00e9chapp\u00e9es, des envol\u00e9es sauvages.\r\nDemain viendra. Et nous regardons les enfants courir la gorge pleine de rire.\r\nDemain viendra. Il nous faudra mourir, s'abandonner, avant les r\u00e9surrections lumineuses. \r\n\r\nLa peur est l\u00e0, parfois, \u00e0 nos c\u00f4t\u00e9s. Ensemble, coudes bien serr\u00e9s, \u00e9coutons le diapason inalt\u00e9rable. Il donne la note des d\u00e9parts. La note juste.\"\r\n\r\nR\u00e9servation obligatoire via notre","performers":"Cr\u00e9ation pluridisciplinaire du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la parole\r\nBal, r\u00e9cit et collectage : Chantal Dejardin\r\nCoordinatrice artistique: Magali Mineur\r\nMaquettes : Thierry Duirat \u2013 https:\/\/www.etymologie-poetique.fr\/\r\nIllustrations : Anne Valletta\r\n\r\nEn collaboration avec Energie commune asbl, pour une cr\u00e9ation pluridisciplinaire et une action de qualit\u00e9 en \u00c9ducation permanente","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 69 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"},"nl":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"},"en":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"},"de":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"},"it":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"},"sp":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"},"pt":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"},"cn":{"name":"Regarde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543982"}},"place":{"id":272222,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Parole","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7\/D","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Des actions culturelles de sens, qui permettent la r\u00e9flexion, pour ne plus \u00eatre sujet d\u2019\u00e9tude mais un.e v\u00e9ritable acteur.rice de sa vie.\r\n\r\nEn \u00e9cho \u00e0 sa programmation, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la parole d\u00e9veloppe des actions culturelles engag\u00e9es, cibl\u00e9es, et adapt\u00e9es aux diff\u00e9rents publics.\r\n\r\nElles ont pour objectifs d\u2019inviter les publics \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir les arts de la parole, et de stimuler les liens interg\u00e9n\u00e9rationnels autour la m\u00e9moire collective.\r\n\r\nLes artistes vont \u00e0 la rencontre des jeunes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations et des adultes autour des questions li\u00e9es \u00e0 la m\u00e9moire, aux savoirs et aux savoir-faire, \u00e0 la parole du quotidien.\r\n\r\nElles prennent la forme d\u2019outils p\u00e9dagogiques en \u00e9ducation permanente, de collectages, d\u2019ateliers et d\u2019animations, de prestations et de rencontres.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Parole","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736