rsonnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-11-08T16:05:04+01:00","published_at":"2022-11-08T15:45:26+01:00","backoffice_id":265309,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.25833941322341},{"id":545068,"date_start":"2022-11-24","date_end":"2023-03-19","date_next":"2022-11-24","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung"}},"others":{"list":[36,39],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Photographie"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Fotografie"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Photography"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Fotografie"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":"Amateur Photography 1860-1930, Dans le cadre de Photo | Brut BXL. Exposition de tintotypes, cyanotypes et albumines originaux. T\u00e9moignages de la cr\u00e9ation intentionnelle ou accidentelle d\u2019artistes anonymes. Autant d\u2019instants magiques et cocasses o\u00f9 l\u2019on entre dans l\u2019intimit\u00e9 de ces inconnus \u00e0 plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle de distance. La Tiny Gallery, petit mus\u00e9e de la photographie amateur.","longdescr":"Intentionnelle ou accidentelle, la photographie amateur nous fascine par ses cr\u00e9ations spontan\u00e9es. Instants magiques et bruts o\u00f9 nous entrons dans l\u2019intimit\u00e9 de ces inconnus \u00e0 plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle de distance. Clins d'oeil \u00e0 la vanit\u00e9 de l'\u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re, ces fant\u00f4mes bienveillants longtemps prot\u00e9g\u00e9s dans l\u2019ombre des albums nous surprennent par leur proximit\u00e9. Albums d\u00e9piaut\u00e9s, dispers\u00e9s, brocant\u00e9s, se livrant et sans d\u00e9fenses, ils sont les t\u00e9moins d\u2019un temps o\u00f9 la photographie n'\u00e9tait pas consid\u00e9r\u00e9e comme dangereuse. C'est avec beaucoup de respect que nous voulons les conserver et aujourd'hui rendre hommage \u00e0 leurs auteurs, ces artistes anonymes. \r\n\r\nQuelques 1\/1000e de seconde qui nous font entrer dans l\u2019intimit\u00e9 de tranches de vie de personnes inconnues \u00e0 plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle de distance.\r\n\r\nExposition de tintotypes, cyanotypes et albumines.  Visites comment\u00e9es.\r\nTinyGallery - Petit mus\u00e9e de la photographie amateur\r\nDu mercredi au dimanche de 15 \u00e0 18 heures et sur rendez-vous","performers":"Photo | Brut BXL\u202fest un projet d\u2019expositions et d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements pluridisciplinaires coordonn\u00e9 par le Centre d\u2019Art Brut et Contemporain La \u00ab\u00a0S\u00a0\u00bb Grand Atelier (Vielsalm) en collaboration avec Bruno Decharme, cet 4 organisations partenaires bas\u00e9es \u00e0 Bruxelles :\u202f la CENTRALE for contemporary art, le\u202fBotanique, le Art et marges mus\u00e9e et la Tiny Gallery.\u00a0","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 475 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"},"nl":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":"Amateur Photography 1860-1930,in het kader van Photo | Brut BXL. Tentoonstelling van originele tintotypes, cyanotypes en albuminen. Getuigenissen van de opzettelijke of toevallige creatie van anonieme kunstenaars. Zoveel magische en komische momenten waarop we de intimiteit van deze vreemden meer dan een eeuw verderop betreden. De Tiny Gallery, een klein museum voor amateurfotografie.","longdescr":"Bedoeld of per ongeluk, amateurfotografie fascineert ons met haar spontane creaties. Magische en rauwe momenten waarop we de intimiteit van deze vreemden meer dan een eeuw verder binnengaan. Een knipoog naar de ijdelheid van het kortstondige, deze welwillende geesten die lang beschermd waren in de schaduw van albums, verrassen ons met hun nabijheid. Gevilde, verspreide, rommelmarktalbums weerloos, getuigen van een tijd waarin fotografie niet als gevaarlijk werd beschouwd. Het is met groot respect dat we ze willen behouden en vandaag hulde brengen aan hun auteurs, deze anonieme kunstenaars.\r\n\r\nEen paar 1\/1000ste van een seconde die ons in de intimiteit brengen van sneetjes leven van mensen die meer dan een eeuw verder onbekend zijn.\r\n\r\nTentoonstelling van tintotypes, cyanotypes en albuminen. Rondleidingen met gids.\r\nTinyGallery - Klein museum voor amateurfotografie\r\nWoensdag t\/m zondag van 15 tot 18 uur en op afspraak","performers":"Photo | Brut BXL is een multidisciplinair tentoonstellings- en evenementenproject geco\u00f6rdineerd door het Centre d'Art Brut et Contemporain La \u201cS\u201d Grand Atelier (Vielsalm) in samenwerking met Bruno Decharme, en 4 Brusselse partnerorganisaties: CENTRALE for contemporary art, Botanique, Art et marges museum en Tiny Gallery.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"},"en":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":"Amateur Photography 1860-1930, As part of Photo | Brut BXL.Exhibition of original tintotypes, cyanotypes and albumen prints. Testimonies of the intentional or accidental creation of anonymous artists. So many magical and comical moments where we enter the intimacy of these strangers more than a century away. The Tiny Gallery, a small museum of amateur photography.","longdescr":"Whether produced intentionally or accidentally, amateur photography fascinates us with its spontaneous creations. Magical, raw moments are captured, allowing us an intimate insight into the lives of strangers who lived over a century ago. In a nod to the vanity of the ephemeral, these benevolent ghosts, who have long been protected by the shadows of the past, surprise us with their proximity. Battered and bruised albums scattered over flea markets surrender to us defencelessly, bearing witness to a time when photography was not considered dangerous. Today, it is with great respect that we wish to preserve these albums and pay tribute to the anonymous artist who authored them.\r\n\r\nA few milliseconds is all it takes to capture an image which transports us into the very hearts of the lives of people we do not know, who lived more than a century ago.\r\n\r\n\r\nExhibition of tintypes, cyanotypes and albumen. Guided tours.\r\nTinyGallery - Small museum of amateur photography\r\nWednesday to Sunday from 3 to 6 p.m. and by appointment","performers":"Photo | Brut BXL is a project of exhibitions and multidisciplinary events coordinated by the Centre d'Art Brut et Contemporain La \u00ab S \u00bb Grand Atelier*in collaboration with Bruno Decharme,  and 4 partner organisations based in Brussels:\u00a0Art et marges museum,\u00a0Botanique, CENTRALE, and Tiny Gallery.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"},"de":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"},"it":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"},"sp":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"},"pt":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"},"cn":{"name":"Spontaneous - Amateur Photography 1860-1930","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545068"}},"place":{"id":275243,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"TinyGallery Brussels","address_street_name":"de la Cuve","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"ogc@ogc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"de la Cuve, 26","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"TinyGalle