he boundless; I like continual uncertainty\u2026\u201d (Gerhard Richter)\r\n\r\nLSD is a series of unmanipulated photographs that celebrate the poetry of daily life. These mysterious images of interiors invite us to connect with our own interiority. In a world that bombards us with clearly defined images every day, this series invite to pause and rediscover our intimate environment. The images, as if in the making in the laboratory, slowly reveal themselves to the viewer. Here we touch at the daily life mystique and transcendence, when all superfluous disappear and only the mystery of life remains. We discover the essence of an interior, its inner halo. By proposing a simplified space removed from all the mundane details, we touch at the essence of life, the core of all representations\u2026light.","performers":"Marianne Behaeghel","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.thepalmbeach.be","email":"sandrineviumasia@thepalmbeach.com","phone_contact":"+32 474 86 42 45","phone_booking":"+32 474 86 42 45","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542766"},"nl":{"name":"Light Sensitive Distortion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542766"},"en":{"name":"Light Sensitive Distortion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542766"},"de":{"name":"Light Sensitive Distortion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542766"},"it":{"name":"Light Sensitive Distortion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performe