 ou international, tels la Figuration narrative, l\u2019art cin\u00e9tique ou l\u2019abstraction belge, en sculpture et en peinture.\r\nLa galerie offre les services du restaurant Martine, directement reli\u00e9 aux espaces d\u2019exposition par une cour jardin, et qui pr\u00e9sente une carte de cuisine saine et innovante.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"patinoire","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Veydtstraat","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Veydtstraat, 15","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Galerij Val\u00e9rie Bach is gevestigd op een uitzonderlijke plek, een industrieel ogend complex dat tot het beschermde Brusselse architecturale erfgoed behoort. De galerij ondersteunt artiesten die in Belgi\u00eb verblijven, en laat het kunstminnend publiek kennismaken met opkomende of reeds befaamde eigentijdse kunstenaars uit het buitenland; schilders en beeldhouwers, plastici of fotografen die de galerij wisten te bekoren en die ze al meerdere jaren volgt in hun werk.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"The Val\u00e9rie Bach gallery is situated in an exceptional place, an industrial-style complex listed as part of Brussels architectural heritage. The gallery focuses at supporting artists living in Belgium and introducing foreign contemporary artists, up-and-coming or established, painters, sculptors, visual artists and photographers who have captured its interest and whose work it has been following for several years.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galer\u00eda Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La galer\u00eda Val\u00e9rie Bach est\u00e1 situada en un lugar excepcional, un complejo de estilo industrial considerado como parte del patromonio arquitect\u00f3nico de Bruselas. La galer\u00eda se centra en apoyar a artistas establecidos en Bruselas y en introducir a artistas extranjeros contempor\u00e1neos, emergentes o ya conocidos, pintores, escultores, artistas visuales y fot\u00f3grafos que han capturado su inter\u00e9s y cuyo trabajo ha sido seguido durante varios a\u00f1os.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[6],"translations":{"fr":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"nl":["Kasteleinswijk\/Baljuw"],"en":["Chatelain\/Bailli"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":"gallery","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5972,"location":{"lat":50.82951017,"lon":4.35696772},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-11-17T02:06:43+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:19:37+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":243615,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach a ouvert ses portes en avril 2015 dans une patinoire \u00e0 roulettes, la premi\u00e8re au monde, construite en 1877, et class\u00e9e monument historique en 1995. La galerie a une programmation construite autour de trois axes: la femme artiste, la monumentalit\u00e9 et une pr\u00e9occupation esth\u00e9tique forte.\r\nLa galerie pr\u00e9sente \u00e9galement des expositions plus historiques, mettant en exergue des mouvements ou des courants de l\u2019art moderne, belge ou international, tels la Figuration narrative, l\u2019art cin\u00e9tique ou l\u2019abstraction belge, en sculpture et en peinture.\r\nLa galerie offre les services du restaurant Martine, directement reli\u00e9 aux espaces d\u2019exposition par une cour jardin, et qui pr\u00e9sente une carte de cuisine saine et innovante.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"patinoire","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Veydtstraat","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Veydtstraat, 15","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Galerij Val\u00e9rie Bach is gevestigd op een uitzonderlijke plek, een industrieel ogend complex dat tot het beschermde Brusselse architecturale erfgoed behoort. De galerij ondersteunt artiesten die in Belgi\u00eb verblijven, en laat het kunstminnend publiek kennismaken met opkomende of reeds befaamde eigentijdse kunstenaars uit het buitenland; schilders en beeldhouwers, plastici of fotografen die de galerij wisten te bekoren en die ze al meerdere jaren volgt in hun werk.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"The Val\u00e9rie Bach gallery is situated in an exceptional place, an industrial-style complex listed as part of Brussels architectural heritage. The gallery focuses at supporting artists living in Belgium and introducing foreign contemporary artists, up-and-coming or established, painters, sculptors, visual artists and photographers who have captured its interest and whose work it has been following for several years.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Veydt, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Patinoire Royale | Galerie Val\u00e9rie Bach","address_street_name":"Rue Veydt","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@prvbgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.prvbgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 03 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_c