t apercevez l\u2019ext\u00e9rieur majestueux de la R\u00e9sidence royale. Sur le plateau du Heysel vous allez d\u00e9couvrir l'Atomium; et embrasser la culture cosmopolite de la tour japonaise et du pavillon chinois.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-city-tours.com\/","email":"info@brussels-city-tours.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 513 77 44","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 77 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545392"},"nl":{"name":"Halfdaagse stadstour van Brussel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545392"},"en":{"name":"Half-day City Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":"This is a great way to discover Brussels. This tour will be an  eye-opener that helps you understand Belgium and to see its links with European history. We advise you to take this excursion upon your arrival in Belgium.","longdescr":"See all the sights of Brussels in a half-day tour on a bus and walking tour. Discover the tourist sites with a multilingual guide.\r\n\r\nYour visit begins with a walk through the historic heart of medieval Brussels. Discover the amazing town hall located on the Grand Place and learn about the city's rich heritage.\r\n\r\nThen, hop aboard a luxury coach to see the city's top sights; you will pass in front of the colossal cathedral of Saint-Michel and Gudule. Marvel at the lavish buildings of the European Quarter and glimpse the majestic exterior of the Royal Residence. On the Heysel district you will discover the Atomium; and embrace the cosmopolitan culture of the Japanese Tower and the Chinese Pavilion.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545392"},"de":{"name":"Le City 