,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"FBIA - Match d'impro championnat 22-23 : Laconiques Anonymes VS Croutounz","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"FBIA - Match d'impro championnat 22-23 : Laconiques Anonymes VS Croutounz","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"FBIA - Match d'impro championnat 22-23 : Laconiques Anonymes VS Croutounz","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-11-18","doors":"20:00:00","start":"20:30:00","end":"23:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":12},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young people"}},"value":6},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T22:06:23+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-16T15:50:22+02:00","backoffice_id":262085,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":545091,"date_start":"2022-11-18","date_end":"2022-11-18","date_next":"2022-11-18","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":"Pr\u00e9sentations d'albums de Baul Meets Saz et de Manush Music","longdescr":"Nous accueillons une soir\u00e9e particuli\u00e8re qui met en avant les voix du quartier de Matonge et de la rue Gray. Un melting pot \u00e0 la sauce ixelloises de personnalit\u00e9s musicales qui vivent, travaillent, s\u2019activent et montent des projets dans le quartier. Une quinzaine d\u2019artistes aux horizons bien diff\u00e9rents. Ce sera aussi une opportunit\u00e9 pour marquer la sortie de deux nouveaux albums d\u2019un tout jeune label, Uren Production : Le premier est l\u2019album \u00ab Banjara \u00bb du groupe Baul meets Saz qui m\u00e9lange des cultures du Bengale et d\u2019Anatolie. Le second album s\u2019intitule Manush Music Vol.1, et est une compilation tr\u00e8s originale de rencontres musicales des plus insolites.\r\n\r\nDu S\u00e9n\u00e9gal \u00e0 l\u2019Inde en passant par la Belgique, le r\u00e9pertoire de cet \u00e9v\u00e9nement sera tr\u00e8s vari\u00e9 autant dans les langues utilis\u00e9es qu\u2019en styles de musique. La particularit\u00e9 de ce projet est qu\u2019il invitera le public \u00e0 participer \u00e0 certains chants. Par une initiation de quelques secondes et avec l\u2019aide des membres de la chorale de la Schola Nova, c\u2019est toute la salle qui sera invit\u00e9e \u00e0 ce voyage musical, po\u00e9tique et esp\u00e9rons-le, transcendantal.\r\n\r\nCe projet a \u00e9t\u00e9 r\u00e9alis\u00e9 en partie gr\u00e2ce au soutien de la commune d\u2019Ixelles, autour de l\u2019appel \u00e0 projet Matongray, d\u2019o\u00f9 le nom de cet ensemble musical.","performers":"Moussa Niang (voix) ; Malabika Brahma (voix) ; Hisham Bilali (Gembri, voix) ; Jackie Jansens (voix) ; Vardan Hovanissian (duduk) ; V\u00e9ronique Gillet (Guitare) ; Rapha\u00ebl De Cock (voix, thatkhan, guimbarde) ; Eren \u00dcren (Bass saz, saz, voix) ; Sanjay Khyapa (dubki, guitar) ; Emre Gultekin (saz, voix) ; Jean-Philippe De Gheest (drums) ; Rapha\u00ebl Feye (Violoncelle) ; Gilles Petit (voix)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"},"nl":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":"Cd-voorstelling Baul Meets Saz & Manush Music","longdescr":"Voices of Matongray is een uniek event waarbij de stemmen van de Matongewijk en de Graystraat centraal staan. Het is een mix van verschillende karakters die in de buurt leven, werken en verschillende projecten uit de grond stampen. Er zullen vijftien artiesten spelen met elk hun verschillende achtergronden. Het is ook een mooie kans om de release van twee nieuwe albums te ontdekken van het splinternieuwe label \u2018Uren Production\u2019. Het eerst album \u201cBanjara\u201d van de groep Baul meets Saz, maakt een mix van de Bengaalse en Anatoolse culturen. Het tweede album heet \u201cManush Music Vol. 1\u201d en is een unieke compilatie van heel uitzonderlijke muzikale samensmeltingen.\r\n\r\nHet repertoire van deze avond dat van Senegal tot India reist en ook een tussenstop in Belgi\u00eb maakt, zal heel gevarieerd zijn in de talen van de uitvoeringen alsook de verschillende muziekstijlen die gebracht worden. Wat event nog specialer maakt is de interactie met het publiek. Na een heel korte initiatie van het koor van de Schola Nova zal het publiek om sommige momenten worden uitgenodigd om mee te doen tijdens de performance.","performers":"Moussa Niang (zang) ; Malabika Brahma (zang) ; Hisham Bilali (guembri, zang) ; Jackie Jansens (zang) ; Vardan Hovanissian (doedoek) ; V\u00e9ronique Gillet (gitaar) ; Rapha\u00ebl De Cock (zang, that khan, guimbarde) ; Eren \u00dcren ( bas saz, saz, zang) ; Sanjay Khyapa (dubki, gitaar) ; Emre Gultekin (saz, zang) ; Jean-Philippe De Gheest (drums) ; Rapha\u00ebl Feye (cello) ; Gilles Petit (zang)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"},"en":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":"Album presentations by Baul Meets Saz and Manush Music","longdescr":"We are hosting a special evening that highlights the voices of the Matonge and Gray Street neighbourhoods. A melting pot of musical personalities who live, work, are active and set up projects in the neighbourhood. About fifteen artists with very different backgrounds. It will also be an opportunity to mark the release of two new albums by a young label, Uren Production: the first is the album \"Banjara\" by the group Baul meets Saz, which mixes Bengal and Anatolian cultures. The second album is entitled Manush Music Vol.1, and is a very original compilation of the most unusual musical encounters.\r\n\r\nFrom Senegal to India via Belgium, the repertoire of this event will be very varied both in the languages used and in the styles of music. The special feature of this project is that the audience will be invited to participate in some of the songs. With the help of the Schola Nova choir, the whole audience will be invited to take part in this musical, poetic and hopefully transcendental journey.\r\n\r\nThis project was partly made possible thanks to the support of the commune of Ixelles, through the Matongray call for projects, hence the name of this musical ensemble.","performers":"Moussa Niang (vocals) ; Malabika Brahma (vocals) ; Hisham Bilali (Gembri, vocals) ; Jackie Jansens (vocals) ; Vardan Hovanissian (duduk) ; V\u00e9ronique Gillet (Guitar) ; Rapha\u00ebl De Cock (vocals, thatkhan, Jew's harp) ; Eren \u00dcren (Bass saz, saz, vocals) ; Sanjay Khyapa (dubki, guitar) ; Emre Gultekin (saz, vocals) ; Jean-Philippe De Gheest (drums) ; Rapha\u00ebl Feye (cello) ; Gilles Petit (vocals)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"},"de":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"},"it":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"},"sp":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"},"pt":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"},"cn":{"name":"Voices of Matongray","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545091"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1