derie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Ransfortstraat, 27","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"De Gieterij biedt al bijna 30 jaar rondleidingen door de stad per boot en te voet aan. Deze rondleidingen, die regelmatig worden bijgewerkt en elk jaar met nieuwe thema's of apparaten worden aangevuld, hebben de goede reputatie gemaakt en trekken elk jaar enkele duizenden bezoekers.   Van kinderen tot senioren, hun rondleidingen zijn gericht op een breed publiek. De meeste rondleidingen worden zowel volgens een vast schema voor individuen en gezinnen, als voor groepen op aanvraag aangeboden. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Fonderie - Brussels museum of industry and labour","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"The Foundry has been offering guided tours of the city by boat and on foot for almost 30 years. Regularly updated, and completed each year with new themes or devices, these tours are a success and attract several thousand visitors each year.   From children to groups of seniors, the target audience for their tours is wide. Most of the tours are available both on a fixed schedule for individuals and families, and for groups on request. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Fonderie - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois de l'Industrie et du Travail","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderi