dernier vendredis du mois de 14:30 \u00e0 18:00","nl":"Open op de eerste, tweede, derde, vierde en laatste vrijdags van de maand van 14:30 tot 18:00","en":"Open the first, second, third, fourth and last fridays of the month from 14:30 to 18:00"}},{"day":"saturday","occurences":{"is_first":true,"is_second":false,"is_third":false,"is_fourth":false,"is_last":false},"time_start":"14:30:00","time_end":"18:00:00","translations":{"fr":"Ouvert le premier samedi du mois de 14:30 \u00e0 18:00","nl":"Open op de eerste zaterdag van de maand van 14:30 tot 18:00","en":"Open the first saturday of the month from 14:30 to 18:00"}}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":59.9}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-11-15T01:08:49+01:00","published_at":"2021-07-19T13:34:44+02:00","backoffice_id":235896,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.12349095796979},{"id":479991,"date_start":"2021-04-01","date_end":"2022-12-31","date_next":"2022-11-18","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen"}},"others":{"list":[99],"translations":{"fr":["Gastronomie"],"nl":["Gastronomie"],"en":["Gastronomy"],"de":["Gastronomie"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["en","nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Tour de bi\u00e8re avec une guide passion\u00e9e","shortdescr":"Visitez une brasserie \r\nD\u00e9gustez 5 bi\u00e8res de haute qualit\u00e9 qui repr\u00e9sente Belgique et Bruxelles\r\nD\u00e9couvrez l'histoire de la trappiste belge, du lambic et d'autres brassins traditionnels\r\nD\u00e9couvrez le vrai go\u00fbt du houblon et des malts \r\nExplorez des lieux cach\u00e9s tels qu'un site historique qui sera bient\u00f4t transform\u00e9 en brasserie\r\nInspirez-vous des futures destinations comme Gand et Bruges","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"nl":{"name":"Ontdek de Brusselse bierwereld met gepassioneerde local incl een chocolade pairing","shortdescr":"Bezoek \u00e9\u00e9n brouwerij \r\nProef 5 degustaties: van traditioneel tot lokale craft\r\nAnekdotes over de lokale prestige: van de Lambiek oorsprong tot de Zennepils\r\nOntdek in primeur een toekomstige craft brouwerij\r\nLeer alles over de traditie, geschiedenis en oorsprong van bier\r\nOntdek de echte smaak van hop en mout\r\nDoe inspiratie op voor nieuwe vakantiebestemmingen binnen Belgi\u00eb","longdescr":"Belgi\u00eb heeft een trotse brouwerstraditie. Al wandelend naar onze eerste locatie onthult Liselot enthousiast alvast wat van de biergeheimen achter het brede Belgische aanbod gerstenat. We maken meteen ook een kleine tussenstop in de favoriete bierwinkel van de gids zodat je je persoonlijke favoriete bieren kan aanwijzen. Zo kunnen we tijdens de bierproeverij rekening houden met je voorkeuren, maar vooral ook nieuwe smaken en verrassende aroma\u2019s aanbrengen.\r\n\r\nDe eerste stop is steeds op \u00e9\u00e9n van de verborgen pareltjes met een middeleeuwse sfeer als achtergrond. Een bierplek die zelfs voor de meeste locals onbekend is. We vliegen er meteen in en proeven ons eerste biertje. Liselot doet er alles aan om het bierbrouwproces van A tot Z uit de doeken te doen, zodat jij alle kennis over bier kan opslorpen op je eigen tempo.Je gids is extreem gepassioneerd en gaat zo op in de interessante biergeheimen, waardoor je haar zeker mag helpen onthouden om de tweede bierdegustatie te starten. Deze proeverij zullen we niet voorbij laten gaan zonder een smakelijke foodpairing. Keek je al reikhalzend uit naar de wereldbekende Belgische chocolade? Dan mag je nu eindelijk proeven van overheerlijke Brusselse chocolade pralines. Wist je dat bier en chocolade verrassend goed samengaat? \r\n\r\nTijd om meer plaatsen te ontdekken. Liselot haar kennis is niet beperkt tot bier: als een trotse Brusselaar, deelt ze graag enkele geheimen over het Belfort, Manneken Pis en de historische Pelgrimse kerk. \r\n\r\nDe volgende bestemming is al even indrukwekkend \u00e9n exclusief. De bars die we samen bezoeken gaan van trendy en modern tot middeleeuws en traditioneel. Voor elk wat wils om in zijn of haar ideale setting bier te proeven. Hier schenken we een heerlijk traditioneel aanbod om te degusteren: een ambachtelijke Trappist en een Brusselse Lambiek mogen niet ontbreken, twee bieren die je de ultieme smaak laat proeven van de typische Belgische bierwereld. Luister tijdens de bierproeverij vooral goed naar de levendige verhalen en anekdotes die Liselot je vertelt over de middeleeuwse paters die in hun abdijen ijverig bier brouwden en daarmee in de 20e eeuw Belgi\u00eb als bierland op de kaart hebben gezet. Dit bezoek wordt verrijkt met een nieuwe foodpairing.\r\n\r\nTijdens onze tweede wandeling heeft Liselot geen schrik om jullie te demonstreren aan wat Brussel deze vruchtbare omgeving heeft te danken. \r\n\r\nHet laatste caf\u00e9 past perfect in het rijtje van levendige en geliefde bierspots. De ideale plek om onze tour te be\u00ebindigen, want van hieruit kan je nog heel wat andere traditionele en moderne plekken ontdekken.\r\n\r\nNa de bierproeverij geeft onze gids Liselot je nog een paar laatste aanbevelingen mee op basis van je nieuwe favoriete bier, zodat je gewoon door kunt gaan met barhoppen. Geniet ervan !","performers":"Dankzij de liefde en kennis voor bier was mijn beslissing snel genomen om in 2019 een full time project te maken van de tours! Deze job is\r\ngewoonweg op mijn lijf geschreven: bezoekers entertainen met zoveel mogelijk verhalen over de geschiedenis, cultuur en hedendaagse wereld van Belgische bieren is wat ik het liefste doe.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"en":{"name":"Discover Brussels' beer world with a passionate young local incl. a chocolat pairing","shortdescr":"Visit a craft brewery \r\nTaste 5 high quality beers \r\nStorytelling of the local prestige: from the Lambic source to the Zennepils\r\nExplore hidden places like a historic site that will transform into a brewery\r\nLearn about the history of Belgium\u2019s Trappist, Lambic and other traditional brews\r\nDiscover the real taste of hops and malts\r\nGet inspiration for new destinations in Belgium","longdescr":"As we make our way to the first brewery, we\u2019ll pass by your guide\u2019s favorite beer shop to find out how familiar you are with the Belgian and local beer portfolio.\r\n\r\nOur first stop will be at our hidden gem inspired with medieval atmosphere. Here, sample your first beer and exchange thoughts on the flavor and notes and soak up the convivial spirit as you chat to your group. If you don\u2019t know the difference between an ale and a lager, listen carefully cause your guide is about to share the secrets of the brewing process. At every venue, we\u2019ll surprise you by combining our beers with some local food to make sure you enjoy the full Belgian beer-and-food experience. So now it\u2019s time to enjoy that delicious Brussels\u2019 chocolate your guide has put on the table for you. \r\n\r\nIt\u2019s time to move on to another lively beer spot. The knowledge of Liselot is more than only about beers: as a proud citizen, she\u2019ll share fascinating novels about Brussels Belfry, Manneken Pis and the historical Pelgrim church. Your sightseeing will be completed with a walking encyclopedia. \r\n\r\nAt our second location, we\u2019ll discover more different styles and further explore the world-famous Belgian brew portfolio. By tasting the very ingredients that make up the brewing process, you\u2019ll feel like you\u2019re visiting a brewery and you\u2019ll get a sense of what makes a beer sour, sweet or bitter. Now, have you ever tried unique Belgian types like Trappists and our local Brussels brews? Make sure your taste buds are ready cause you are about to be introduced to the widest range of Belgian beers you have ever seen in just one bar. This visit will be completed with another surprising local food pairing.\r\n\r\nFor our second promenade, Liselot demonstrates how Brussels got this fertiled environment to make Lambic beers. Only a few metres further, you\u2019ll hear more history of the old city wall and a recognised statue. \r\n\r\nLast but not least, at your 3rd location you\u2019 ll be introduced to the upscaling local craft beer market and will get the chance to try an exclusive beer you can only find in this town. Have you found your new favourite beer? Explore variants of it and make the most of these last moments together!\r\n\r\nAfter 3 hours, your tour will come to a close in the nicest area of town where you will be free to spend time with your new friends or to continue this unique beer experience.","performers":"In a fun and entertaining way, there\u2019s nothing I love more than talking about the city, our culture and history of Belgian beers, so much so that it\u2019s my full-time life\u2019s work! Join me and together let\u2019s discover your favourite Belgian beer!","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"de":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"it":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"sp":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"pt":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"cn":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"}},"place":{"id":266754,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 188","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Antoine Dansaertstraat","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Antoine Dansaertstraat, 188","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 188","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Take part in an interactive and tasty beer tour in historical Brussels, Ghent or Bruges. In a small group you will learn about the history of beer, immerse yourself in the brewing process and discover the reasons behind  Belgian beer\u2019s worldwide fame. Savour a mix of traditional and craft beers paired with  artisan chocolate and other local delicacies. With the right mix of knowledge and humour, a young, passionate guide will reveal tantalizing beer secrets and tell you all about the rich world of Belgian beers. Our promise: the guarantee that you\u2019ll go home with a new favorite beer style after this unique tour.\r\nSince Covid-19, Liselot also developed virtual brewery tours with food pairing : a way to taste Belgium from home and get a virtual guide in diverse breweries while learning lots of interesting tips and fun facts.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","addre