g Dealers","shortdescr":"Swing Dealers est form\u00e9 autour du saxophoniste Vincent Mardens et le bassiste\/chanteur Jean Van Lint.\r\nLe m\u00e9lange du saxophone et de la voix cr\u00e9e le son unique qui caract\u00e9rise le groupe.\r\n\r\nLe style de musique \u00e9videmment inspir\u00e9 par le 'swing' des ann\u00e9es 50 et 60, est \u00e9galement fortement influenc\u00e9 par des sons plus 'so\u00fbl' et contemporains","longdescr":"Swing Dealers est form\u00e9 autour du saxophoniste Vincent Mardens et le bassiste\/chanteur Jean Van Lint.\r\nLe m\u00e9lange du saxophone et de la voix cr\u00e9e le son unique qui caract\u00e9rise le groupe.\r\n\r\nLe style de musique \u00e9videmment inspir\u00e9 par le 'swing' des ann\u00e9es 50 et 60, est \u00e9galement fortement influenc\u00e9 par des sons plus 'so\u00fbl' et contemporains","performers":"Jean Van Lint contrebasse chant\r\nVincent Marden, saxophone\r\nPascal Michauw, piano ou Dirck Vanderlinden \r\nJan de Hass, drums","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","email":"info@cotevillage.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 346 78 38","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"},"nl":{"name":"Gershwing Dealers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"},"en":{"name":"Gershwing Dealers","shortdescr":"The great Georges Gershwin\u2019s Repertoire revisited by SWINGDealers","longdescr":"The great Georges Gershwin\u2019s Repertoire revisited by SWINGDealers","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"},"de":{"name":"\" Gershwing Dealers \"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"},"it":{"name":"\" Gershwing Dealers \"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"},"sp":{"name":"\" Gershwing Dealers \"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"},"pt":{"name":"\" Gershwing Dealers \"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"},"cn":{"name":"\" Gershwing Dealers \"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540946"}},"place":{"id":233318,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":"+32 2 346 78 38","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717\/A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village est le caf\u00e9-th\u00e9\u00e2tre par excellence d'Uccle depuis plus de 20 ans et peut maintenant se targuer d'une liste impressionnante d'invit\u00e9s. Un certain Adamo, Philip Catherine et Maurane ont donn\u00e9 le meilleur d'eux-m\u00eames ici. Souvenirs dor\u00e9s pour ceux qui \u00e9taient l\u00e0 \u00e0 l'\u00e9poque, en petit comit\u00e9. Mais C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village, c'est bien plus que cela. C'est l\u00e0 que naissent les artistes et humoristes de demain, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des stages et des formations intensives selon la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre m\u00e9thode de l\u2019Actors Studio\u00a9.  Ce lieu charismatique dot\u00e9 d\u2019une mission vous charmera \u00e0 coup s\u00fbr.        \r\n\r\n \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Waterloose Steenweg","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":"+32 2 346 78 38","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Waterloose Steenweg, 717\/A","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village is al meer dan 20 jaar lang h\u00e9t Ukkelse theatercaf\u00e9 bij uitstek en kan ondertussen uitpakken met een indrukwekkende lijst aan gastoptredens. Grote sterren uit de Franse cultuur zoals Adamo, Philip Catherine en Maurane gaven hier ooit het beste van zichzelf. Gouden herinneringen voor wie er toen bij was, en petit comit\u00e9. C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village is echter meer dan dat. Hier worden de artiesten en humoristen van morgen geboren dankzij intensieve stages en opleidingen volgens de befaamde Actors Studio\u00a9-methode. Deze charismatische plek met een missie zal je zeker bekoren.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":"+32 2 346 78 38","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717\/A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":" \u2018C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village\u2019, the landmark caf\u00e9 and theatre in Uccle is celebrating its 20th birthday\r\nTwenty years of \u2018evenings among friends\u2019, dedicated to helping local artists meet their audience (allowing them to wander freely through the art) and dedicated to welcoming artists of great calibre, with improbable duos such as Nilda Fernandez and Adamo or Arielle Dombasle and Philippe Katerine. Dedicated, too, to artists who have passed on, such as Georges Moustaki, Michel Delpech and Maurane.\r\nIt also aims to train the artists of tomorrow with the l\u2019\u00c9cole de Th\u00e9\u00e2tre M\u00e9thode Actors Studio\u00a9.\u2019","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":"+32 2 346 78 38","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717\/A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 78 38","phone_booking":"+32 2 346 78 38","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 717\/A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"C\u00f4t\u00e9 Village","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"717","address_street_box":"A","email":"info@cotevillage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cotevillage.be","phon