updated_at":"2022-11-03T15:35:04+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:10+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/78976f34ad129cadb0664d9f4848254bcdacc5b4.png","width":2942,"height":2476,"ratio":1.19,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Gershwing Dealers","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Gershwing Dealers","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Gershwing Dealers","copyright":null}}},{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/1fa9c709e0d8b7031cfb3b4fdacce639d9aa8ec3.png","width":2942,"height":2476,"ratio":1.19,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Gershwing Dealers","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Gershwing Dealers","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Gershwing Dealers","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-11-19","doors":"20:00:00","start":"20:30:00","end":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":20}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[539149],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[326],"translations":{"fr":["Jazz"],"nl":["Jazz"],"en":["Jazz"],"de":["Jazz"]}},"visit_content":{"list":[360],"values":["cafe-theatre"]},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-11-03T15:35:05+01:00","published_at":"2022-09-05T09:11:18+02:00","backoffice_id":260946,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":543782,"date_start":"2022-11-19","date_end":"2022-11-19","date_next":"2022-11-19","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"],"de":["Theater"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u00c0 l\u2019occasion de ses 10 ans d\u2019existence, l\u2019ASBL Singularit\u00e9s Plurielles a le plaisir de vous proposer une Rencontre Singuli\u00e8re autour de la nouvelle pi\u00e8ce de th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Compagnie L\u2019App\u00e9tit des Indigestes : \u00ab Elles \u00bb.\r\n\r\n\u00ab Elles \u00bb est une \u00ab variation polyphonique \u00bb \u00e0 20 voix autours de la question du corps, des femmes et de la folie. Il s\u2019agit d\u2019une mise en mots et en gestes d\u2019un foisonnement d\u2019exp\u00e9riences singuli\u00e8res autour des menstruations, de la violence, de la tendresse, du viol, de\r\n\r\nla prostitution, de la masturbation, de l\u2019amour, de la m\u00e9nopause, de l\u2019avortement, de la grossesse et du lien entre les hommes et les femmes.\r\n\r\nCe spectacle veut porter la parole collective et multiple des acteurs\/trices autour de souvenirs corporels qui les hantent ou les amusent. Le texte se d\u00e9ploie comme une partition, avec ses passages rapides, ses moments forts, ses silences, ses ralentissements. Les voix se relayent, s\u2019enchev\u00eatrent, se reprennent. Les histoires sont tress\u00e9es ensemble afin de mettre \u00e0 plat les tabous et d\u2019inviter le spectateur \u00e0 se situer par rapport \u00e0 son propre v\u00e9cu corporel.\r\n\r\nLa pi\u00e8ce sera suivie d\u2019un moment d\u2019\u00e9change avec tous les spectateurs.trices qui le souhaitent, dans une id\u00e9e de partage et de cr\u00e9ation de liens.\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/singularitesplurielles...\r\n\r\nDirection artistique, dramaturgie et mise en sc\u00e8ne : Sophie Muselle\r\n\r\nAssist\u00e9e par : Pierrot Renaux\r\n\r\nAvec : Selma Akim, Nadia Begue, Sophie Berruyer, Roxane Dury, Carine Frisque, Julie Govaerts, Loup Korakas, Joachim Libouton, Philippe Magnet, Micha\u00ebl Magerat, Pierrot Renaux, Sami Riahi, G\u00e9raldine Sauvage, Clara Teicher, Noa Teicher, Nicole Tonneau, Sema Ustun, Valentin, Wathelet et Marco Willems.\r\n\r\nHoraires\r\n\r\nSamedi 19 novembre - 20.00\r\n\r\nTarifs\r\n\r\nNous aimerions qu\u2019un maximum de personnes puisse acc\u00e9der \u00e0 cette repr\u00e9sentation, c\u2019est pourquoi diff\u00e9rents tarifs sont propos\u00e9s :\r\n\r\nQuelques tickets gratuits pour les personnes qui n'auraient pas les moyens\r\n\r\n7 euros pour \u00e9tudiants et ch\u00f4meurs\r\n\r\n15 euros au tarif plein\r\n\r\nLes b\u00e9n\u00e9fices de la soir\u00e9e serviront \u00e0 alimenter notre caisse de solidarit\u00e9. Que vous assistiez au spectacle ou pas, il est aussi possible de faire un don pour les personnes qui souhaiteraient nous soutenir dans la d\u00e9marche d\u2019offrir des soins accessibles aux personnes et familles ayant des faibles revenus.\r\n\r\nR\u00e9servations ici \r\nhttps:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/renocntre-singuliere-elles","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejacquesfranck.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"},"nl":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"},"en":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"},"de":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"},"it":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"},"sp":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"},"pt":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"},"cn":{"name":"Elles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543782"}},"place":{"id":4,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel Jacques Franck","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"94","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 94","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Le Centre culturel Jacques Franck est situ\u00e9 dans une des grandes art\u00e8res commerciales de Saint-Gilles. A l\u2019origine un petit cin\u00e9ma de quartier baptis\u00e9 le \u00ab Saint-Gillois \u00bb et ensuite transform\u00e9 en th\u00e9\u00e2tre, le lieu est finalement affect\u00e9 comme centre culturel par le S\u00e9nateur-Bourgmestre Jacques Franck. Lieu de rencontre, de dialogue, de d\u00e9bat culturel, la programmation