TY \u2022 BACK 2 MUSIC 2000-2010 |  Belges Jeunesses","shortdescr":"Rendez-vous ce SAMEDI 19 NOVEMBRE dans la serre magique de Pleine Publiek (Mont des Arts) d\u00e8s 22h30\r\nOn t'annonce du lourd & plein d'autres surprises au plus vite...  \r\nInfo\u2019s\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\n\u2192 Samedi 19 novembre de 22h30 \u00e0 4h00","longdescr":"This Saturday 19.11 at Plein Publiek BXL \/ Back to school\r\n\u2729 Mont des Arts PARTY \u2022 BACK 2 MUSIC 2000-2010 | Plein Publiek BXL x Belges Jeunesses \u2022 SAM 19.11 \u2729\r\nThe best of  2000s-2010s | The Ultimate Party\r\nGaranty pass : www.eventbrite.be\/e\/billets-mont-des-arts-party-by-les-belges-jeunesses-back-to-2000-2010-1911-458258342037\r\n> https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/26BkcO9RG (Great Party)\r\n\r\nLes Belges Jeunesses x Plein Publiek BXL\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\nMont des Arts + AMAZING WINTER  TERRACE\r\nLine Up \u266b DJ G-Froy\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\nViens t\u2019\u00e9clater avec tes copines et r\u00e9alise ton r\u00eave sur les meilleurs sons de ta g\u00e9n\u00e9ration !\r\n Britney Spears, David Guetta, Avicci\u2026 Et pleins d\u2019autres !","performers":"Plein Publiek Bxl x Les Belges Jeunesses","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/belgesjeunesses","email":"gabriel@lesbelgesjeunesses.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 28 74 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 28 74 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545521"},"nl":{"name":"\u2729 Mont des Arts PARTY \u2022 BACK 2 MUSIC 2000-2010 |  Belges Jeunesses","shortdescr":"Tot zaterdag 19 NOVEMBER in de magische serre van Pleine Publiek (Mont des Arts) vanaf 22.30 uur.\r\nWe kondigen zo snel mogelijk zware & tal van andere verrassingen aan...\r\nInfo's\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\n\u2192 Zaterdag 19 november van 22.30 uur tot 4.00 uur","longdescr":"Kom en maak plezier met je vrienden en maak je droom waar op de beste geluiden van je generatie!\r\n Britney Spears, David Guetta, Avicci\u2026 En nog veel meer!\r\n\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\nTot zaterdag 19 NOVEMBER in de magische serre van Pleine Publiek (Mont des Arts) vanaf 22.30 uur.\r\nWe kondigen zo snel mogelijk zware & tal van andere verrassingen aan...\r\nInfo's\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\n\u2192 Zaterdag 19 november van 22.30 uur tot 4.00 uur\r\n\u2192 Vergeet niet een voorverkoop te doen voor de avond om de wachtrij te vermijden\r\n\u2192 Goed bereikbaar met openbaar vervoer, fiets of scooter!\r\n\u2192 De directie behoudt zich het recht van toegang voor\r\n\u2192 Minimaal 20 jaar oud\r\n------------------------\r\nVolledige Publiek BXL ~ Paleis van de Dynastie\r\nKunstberg (Kunstberg) 5, 1000 Brussel Kunst (Kunstberg) 5, 1000 Brussel","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545521"},"en":{"name":"\u2729 Mont des Arts PARTY \u2022 BACK 2 MUSIC 2000-2010 |  Belges Jeunesses","shortdescr":"Come and have fun with your friends and make your dream come true on the best sounds of your generation!\r\n Britney Spears, David Guetta, Avicci\u2026 And many more!","longdescr":"This Saturday 19.11 at Plein Publiek BXL \/ Back to school\r\n\u2729 Mont des Arts PARTY \u2022 BACK 2 MUSIC 2000-2010 | Plein Publiek BXL x Belges Jeunesses \u2022 SAM 19.11 \u2729\r\nThe best of  2000s-2010s | The Ultimate Party\r\nGaranty pass : www.eventbrite.be\/e\/billets-mont-des-arts-party-by-les-belges-jeunesses-back-to-2000-2010-1911-458258342037\r\n> https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/26BkcO9RG (Great Party)\r\n\r\nLes Belges Jeunesses x Plein Publiek BXL\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\nCome and have fun with your friends and make your dream come true on the best sounds of your generation!\r\n Britney Spears, David Guetta, Avicci\u2026 And many more!\r\n\r\n\u2594\u2594\