2004 sous l\u2019impulsion des organisations litt\u00e9raires Het beschrijf et Entrez Lire, elle est aujourd\u2019hui un lieu unique en son genre, au c\u0153ur de l\u2019Europe. Une maison plurillingue qui permet aux auteurs, lecteurs, traducteurs et autres amoureux litt\u00e9raires de se rencontrer et de s\u2019inspirer mutuellement. \r\nRencontres litt\u00e9raires (intra et extra muros), d\u00e9bats d\u2019id\u00e9es, cr\u00e9ations de textes, clubs de lecture, traductions, collectif de po\u00e8tes\u2026 Passa Porta se veut \u00e0 la fois exigeante et ouverte \u00e0 tous. La maison g\u00e8re \u00e9galement un programme international pour les \u00e9crivains en r\u00e9sidence. \r\nLe festival Passa Porta (un des plus prestigieux d\u2019Europe), a lieu tous les deux ans et attire plusieurs milliers de curieux et\/ou passionn\u00e9s dans une vingtaine de lieux culturels bruxellois. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Antoine Dansaertstraat","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 226 04 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Antoine Dansaertstraat, 46","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Passa Porta is het internationale literatuurhuis in Brussel. Het werd opgericht in 2004 door literaire organisaties Het beschrijf en Entrez Lire en heeft sindsdien een unieke plek ingenomen in het hart van Europa. Passa Porta is een meertalig huis, een werk- en ontmoetingsplek voor auteurs, lezers, vertalers en andere literatuurliefhebbers uit de hele wereld. \r\nNaast literaire ontmoetingen (intra en extra muros), leesclubs, en diverse creatieprojecten voor auteurs en vertalers, ontwikkelt Passa Porta ook een internationaal programma voor writers-in-residence.\r\nHet tweejaarlijkse Passa Porta Festival, h\u00e9t internationale literatuurfestival van Belgi\u00eb, is zeer gewaardeerd in heel Europa en trekt vele duizenden bezoekers. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 226 04 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 46","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Passa Porta is the international house of literature in Brussels. Founded in 2004 by the organizations Het beschrijf and Entrez Lire, it is a multilingual organization in the heart of Europe. A unique place where all kinds of literature lovers, authors, readers, translators and cultural mediators can meet and work.\r\nIt offers literary encounters, creative projects for authors and translators and an international program for writers in residence. \r\nPassa Porta also organizes the biennial Passa Porta Festival, one of the most prestigious literary festivals in Europe. It attracts thousands of visitors to more than twenty locations in Brussels.     \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 226 04 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.