urs contemporains.","longdescr":"Les invit\u00e9s : Alena Morn\u0161tajnov\u00e1 (22 septembre, Plan\u00e9tarium de Bruxelles), Petr Hru\u0161ka (12 octobre, Tropismes), Mark\u00e9ta Pil\u00e1tov\u00e1 & J\u00e1chym Topol (30 novembre, Passa Porta). En concordance avec la conference \"Le R\u00eave tch\u00e8que\" (5 d\u00e9cembre, ULB).\r\n\r\nPlus d'informations: https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/programme\/setkani-s-ceskou-literaturou?locale=fr","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/en\/program\/setkani-s-ceskou-literaturou?locale=en","email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536050"},"nl":{"name":"Ontmoeting met de Tsjechische literatuur","shortdescr":"Een reeks lezingen en literaire evenementen met Tsjechische auteurs.","longdescr":"Met: Alena Morn\u0161tajnov\u00e1 (22 september, Planetarium van Brussel), Petr Hru\u0161ka (12 october, Tropismes), Mark\u00e9ta Pil\u00e1tov\u00e1 & J\u00e1chym Topol (30 november, Passa Porta).\r\nRandevenement: conferentie over Tsjechische literatuur na 1989: de Tsjechische droom (5 december, ULB).\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/nl\/het-programma\/setkani-s-ceskou-literaturou?locale=nl","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/programme\/setkani-s-ceskou-literaturou?locale=fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536050"},"en":{"name":"Meet Czech Literature","shortdescr":"A series of readings and literary events with Czech authors.","longdescr":"Featuring: Alena Morn\u0161tajnov\u00e1 (22 September, Planetarium of Brussels), Petr Hru\u0161ka (12 October, Tropismes), Mark\u00e9ta Pil\u00e1tov\u00e1 & J\u00e1chym Topol (30 November, Passa Porta). Affiliated event: a conference on Czech literature after 1989 (5 December, ULB).